== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* The MAX MAXIMIZER BGM in REFLEC BEAT colette is based on ARACHNE.
* A remix of ARACHNE by [[Kento Oizumi|DJ Noriken]], titled [[ARACHNE(DJ Noriken Remix)]], appears on the ''REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!＋colette ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK'' album.
** A short version of ARACHNE(DJ Noriken Remix) can be found in [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]].
* ARACHNE appears as part of the medley [[The 6th KAC DJ TOTTO's SELECTION]], from [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]].

== Trivia ==
* ARACHNE is the final unlock of the first Phase of REFLEC BEAT colette -Spring-'s ''Pastel Adventure'' colette Garden unlocking system. To obtain it, you must have bloomed the Dog-shaped Seed (イヌに似たたね).
** From REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], ARACHNE was playable by default.
* Arachne is Greek for spider.
** Arachne was a young mortal woman in Greco-Roman mythology who boasted that her skills were greater than Athena, goddess of wisdom and strategy. Athena was so offended that she eventually turned her into a spider.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], ARACHNE was revived on January 18th, 2018.
* ARACHNE is available in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ from October 11th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* ARACHNE could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from August 1st to September 24th, 2024, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 15 stamps.
** Since September 11th, 2025, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* ARACHNE is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from June 19th, 2025, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.36''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.36).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, ARACHNE can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From June 30th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, it is available by default for all players.

