== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is part of the BabeL song series.
** Part of BabeL ～Next Story～'s melody is sampled in [[BabeL ~MODEL DD101~|BabeL ～MODEL DD101～]].
* The first three BabeL songs are combined together into ''BabeL ～Stairway to Heaven～'', a 10:22 medley by [[Tsugumi Kataoka|BPO]] featured in the [[pop'n music 19 TUNE STREET original soundtrack]] and [[pop'n music Usagi to neko to shounen no yume Original Soundtrack|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 Original Soundtrack 20th Anniversary Edition]] albums.
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is featured in the medley [[Popperz Chronicle]], from [[AC pnm peace|pop'n music peace]].

== Trivia ==
[[Image:Tower_dummy.png|thumb|BabeL ～Grand Story～'s placeholder character.]]
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is one of the TOWN MAX unlocks in pop'n music 19 TUNE STREET's TOWN MODE.
** It can be unlocked in TOWN MODE for 200 TP after unlocking [[BabeL ~Grand Story~|BabeL ～Grand Story～]] and entering the second stage of the tower.
* BabeL ～Next Story～'s EX chart has a [[Spicy Gauge]].
* BabeL ～Next Story～ marks the first time when a Daichi Watanabe song is credited to his Power Of Nature alias.
* the TOWER is not selectable as a player character in pop'n music. 
* When pop'n music 19 TUNE STREET was released, the data for the BabeL songs was incomplete, and a placeholder "character" (which looks like a yellow haniwa) was shown in BabeL ～Next Story～'s portrait.
* BabeL ～Next Story～'s HYPER chart has the second highest number of notes of any non-long version HYPER chart, with 1378, only behind [[virkato no shudai ni yoru person09 fuu chouzetsu gikou hensoukyoku|virkatoの主題によるperson09風超絶技巧変奏曲]]'s UPPER chart, with 1425.
** With 540 notes, BabeL ～Next Story～'s 5-Buttons chart also held the record with the third highest notecount in a pop'n music 5-Buttons chart, behind [[mu9|μ9]]'s 543 and [[BI-BUN-SEKI-BUn]]'s 587 notes.
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is a song part of the [[POLICY BREAK]] event. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked in the SOUND VOLTEX series, please see the event page.
** From September 12th, 2019 in [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]] and from October 2nd, 2019 in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]], it can be purchased with PCB instead.
* If one looks at BabeL ～Next Story～'s jacket more closely, [[Nyami]] and [[Mimi]] can be seen climbing up the TOWER.
* After the removal of all backgrounds in [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]], BabeL ～Next Story～'s background was added to the TOWER's animations in pop'n music ラピストリア on August 14th, 2014. This change was reverted in [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], with the return of backgrounds for pre-ラピストリア songs.
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.3''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.3).
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 13th, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* BabeL ～Next Story～ is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from June 19th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.pop'n music vol.1''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.pop'n music vol.1).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, BabeL ～Next Story～ can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From June 30th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, it is available by default for all players.

