== Trivia ==
* Hollywood Galaxy is one of the hidden songs of REFLEC BEAT. It can be unlocked from July 14th, 2011 (as part of the REFLEC BEAT Ver.1.5 update) by playing [[ANDROMEDA -SF_2011 Mix-]], [[DIORAMATIC MOMENT]], [[robin]] and [[Marude matryoshka|まるでマトリョーシカ]].
** In [[AC RB limelight|REFLEC BEAT limelight]], it's unlocked by reaching the third part of Glass Stage 1-3. It is the 25th old REFLEC BEAT song in limelight unlocked via Glass Stage.
** In [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]], it is unlocked by reaching Stage 9 of Pastel Adventure (パステルアドベンチャー) in Reflecting Mountain (初代リフレク山).
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was available by default.
* According to dj TAKA, Hollywood Galaxy was produced when then current REFLEC BEAT sound director [[Tatsuya Iyama|Qrispy Joybox]] requested him to make a song similar to that of [[Mei|冥]].
* Hollywood Galaxy is the ''REFLEC BEAT LIMIT BURST (EXTRA STAGE)'' of beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro. It became unlockable on November 21st, 2012.
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], its NORMAL, HYPER, and ANOTHER charts can be unlocked by obtaining 130, 139, and 148 Tran Medals respectively.
** As of July 24th, 2014, it could be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and [[AC PENDUAL|22 PENDUAL]] through the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event.
** As of July 1st, 2015, it could be purchased in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL with ''Youkou no hologram'' (陽光のホログラム).
** As of [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]], it is available by default.
* Hollywood Galaxy received a SPECIAL chart in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. It could be unlocked from August 14th, 2014 to August 27th, 2014 in the ''PASTEL WONDER QUEST'' (パステルワンダークエスト) event of REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. To unlock it, you must win 20 times in a row on Legend difficulty in the Wonder Coliseum (ワンダーコロシアム).
** From August 28th, 2014, it could be purchased from the REFLEC Shop for 9000 Refle.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased from the Garage for 8 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked by clearing its HARD chart a specific number of times, depending on the grade obtained on it (AAA+: 1 time, AAA: 2 times, AA: 3 times, A or lower: 5 times).
* Hollywood Galaxy can be unlocked in jubeat Qubell as the ''掘りすぎ dig RUSH 5th dig REFLEC BEAT'' STAGE 2 unlock of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system. For more information on the dates it can be unlocked, please see [[AC jb Qubell/QUBE Availability|this page]].
