** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Hollywood Galaxy was revived on June 29th, 2017.
* Hollywood Galaxy is one of the qualifying round songs in [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|The 8th KONAMI Arcade Championship]] for [[AC Rootage|beatmania IIDX 26 Rootage]].
* Hollywood Galaxy is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.4''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.4).
* Hollywood Galaxy's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Hollywood Galaxy is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from February 14th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, Hollywood Galaxy can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From February 27th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, it is available by default for all players.

