== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* Lisa-RICCIA is part of DJ YOSHITAKA's JOMANDA song series.
* A remix of Lisa-RICCIA by [[Genki Hikota|DJ Genki]], titled ''Lisa-RICCIA(DJ Genki Remix)'', appears in the [[beatnation RHYZE vs HARDCORE TANO*C]] album.
* A symphonic medley of [[JOMANDA]], [[VALLIS-NERIA]], and Lisa-RICCIA by [[Kennosuke Ono|onoken]], titled ''JOMANDA・VALLIS-NERIA・Lisa-RICCIA (Orchestra Arr.) スペシャルメドレー'', can be found on the [[BEMANI SYMPHONY ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK]] album.
** A short version of the Lisa-RICCIA part of the above medley, titled [[Lisa-RICCIA (BEMANI SYMPHONY Arr.)]], appears in [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]].
* A remastered version of Lisa-RICCIA was performed at the ''EDP × beatnation summit 2025'' event held on October 12th, 2025.
** It is included as ''Lisa-RICCIA -Comeback Update-'' in the [[cyber beatnation 3 -non-stop best conclusion-]] album released on the same day.
** This version is later used in the beatmania IIDX and DanceDanceRevolution series.

== Trivia ==
* Lisa-RICCIA can be unlocked in jubeat saucer and REFLEC BEAT colette -Autumn- from November 13th, 2013 as part of the [[Pastel-kun to Smith-shi no RUNRUN marathon!]] (パステルくんとスミス氏のRUNRUNマラソン!) crossover event. It is the unlockable song of the Mission DELTA, after both Pastel-kun and Smith-shi complete 40 laps around the track.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from May 1st, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** As of [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is available by default by playing with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Lisa-RICCIA could be purchased at the REFLEC Shop for 1000 Refle.
* ''Riccia'' is a genus of liverworts in the order ''Marchantiales''.
* Both JOMANDA's and VALLIS-NERIA's jacket characters appear in the background of Lisa-RICCIA's jacket.
** Lisa-RICCIA's jacket character made a brief appearance in the beatmania IIDX video of VALLIS-NERIA before Lisa-RICCIA itself was released.
* Lisa-RICCIA marks Yoshitaka Nishimura's first non-BEMANI crossover/collaboration to be in a core jubeat game (as opposed to the APPEND games) since [[Evans]] from the original [[AC jb|jubeat]].
** It's also his second song to simultaneously debut in jubeat and REFLEC BEAT, after [[FLOWER]] in [[AC jb knit APPEND|jubeat knit APPEND]] and [[AC RB|REFLEC BEAT]].
* Lisa-RICCIA is currently DJ Yoshitaka's latest solo song in BEMANI.
* Lisa-RICCIA is the last brand-new KONAMI original in jubeat saucer.
** The last one made exclusively '''for''' jubeat saucer, though, is [[Gimme a Big Beat]].
* To unlock Lisa-RICCIA in jubeat plus or REFLEC BEAT plus, you must have purchased the three RUNRUNマラソン！ packs in jubeat plus or REFLEC BEAT plus respectively. Then, you can download the song by tapping the Gift button at the Store.
** Since August 5th, 2016, it can be downloaded without any requisites.
* Lisa-RICCIA's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]] ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Lisa-RICCIA was revived on November 2nd, 2017.
** Its WHITE HARD chart could be unlocked through a quest in Reflesia Mode (リフレシアモード) from November 9th to 22nd, 2017.
*** Since March 8th, 2018, it is available by default.
* Lisa-RICCIA is part of the [[Maishuu! Ichika no chou BEMANI rush 2020]] (毎週！いちかの超BEMANIラッシュ2020) event. It could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE from September 9th, 2020 until October 29th, 2020.
** As of December 16th, 2021 in [[AC SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR]], it can be purchased with PCB.
* Lisa-RICCIA is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from September 19th, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* Lisa-RICCIA was added to beatmania IIDX 33 Sparkle Shower on November 19th, 2025, first announced on the ''BEMANI Namahousou(kari)'' (BEMANI生放送（仮）) livestream at AMUSEMENT EXPO 2025, along with a preview of its unique video [https://x.com/IIDX_OFFICIAL/status/1989499358300225754].
** Its LEGGENDARIA charts are the ''Lisa-RICCIA TOURISM 2'' unlock of beatmania IIDX 33 Sparkle Shower's ''WORLD TOURISM'' event. They can be unlocked from November 19th, 2025.
* Lisa-RICCIA is the ''DELTA'' unlock of DanceDanceRevolution WORLD's ''GALAXY BRAVE'' unlock event. It can be unlocked from July 9th, 2026.
** The name of its ''GALAXY BRAVE'' Trial Room, ''DELTA'', is a reference to the fact it was the unlockable song of the Mission DELTA in the パステルくんとスミス氏のRUNRUNマラソン! event for both jubeat saucer and REFLEC BEAT colette -Autumn-.
*** The song selection for this Trial Room is also based on said event, with [[spring pony]] representing the 1st Annual Meeting, [[Broken]] representing the 2nd Annual Meeting, and [[Windy Fairy]] representing the 3rd Annual Meeting ([[Yoshihiro Tagawa|DJ TOTTO]] Meeting).

