* LubedeR is available in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course and [[CS SDVX EG|EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from June 8th, 2021, by purchasing its '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.13''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.13).
