== Trivia ==
* Proof of the existence is the SECTOR B boss song of beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro's ''Ω-ATTACK'', and the final song of the event itself.
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], its NORMAL, HYPER, and ANOTHER charts can be unlocked by obtaining 79, 87, and 95 Tran Medals respectively.
** As of July 24th, 2014, it could be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and [[AC PENDUAL|22 PENDUAL]] through the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event.
** As of July 1st, 2015, it could be purchased in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL with ''Youkou no hologram'' (陽光のホログラム).
** As of [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]], it is available by default.
* Proof of the existence marks the first Naoyuki Sato song to be rated Level 12 on Single ANOTHER difficulty in beatmania IIDX.
* The bosses in Proof of the existence's overlays are ''Blue Lupica'' and ''Blue Repika'', joker villains in the story of beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro. They are combined as ''Rerupika'', a huge, blue and white mech with blue crystals floating around it.
** During the Ω-ATTACK event, Blue Lupica is manipulated by Blue Repika.
** When you miss a note, both characters will appear, with Blue Repika manipulating Blue Lupica to attack the Q-pro avatar with an energy beam.
** In the last cutscene of Ω-ATTACK, Blue Repika will retreat while Blue Lupica, alongside Phoenix from [[Torikago no houou|トリカゴノ鳳凰]], joins Q-pro during the ''OUR SPACE WAR (ぼくらの宇宙戦争)'' event. 
* Proof of the existence could be unlocked from February 27th, 2013 to March 3rd, 2014 in jubeat saucer as part of the [[Cafe de Tran|Café de Tran]] unlock system. It was the fourth unlockable song for that game.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from May 1st, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* In the U.S./EU iTunes version of the ''beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK Vol.1'' album, the last word in Proof of the existence's title is now spelled with an upper-case E, and the artist name is now credited to '''Nekomata_Master+'''.
** Its artist is also romanized as Nekomata_Master+ in REFLEC BEAT +.
** In jukebeat, Proof of the existence's artist is romanized as '''Nekomata-Master+''' instead.
* Proof of the existence appears in REFLEC BEAT colette -Summer- as part of the [[Q-pro, Mimi, Nyami & Pastel-kun no minna de uchuu sensou!!]] (クプロ・ミミニャミ・パステルくんのみんなで宇宙戦争!!) unlock event, which started on July 29th, 2013.
** In [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] and [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]], Proof of the existence could be unlocked through the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki]] (発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡) event.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Proof of the existence was playable by default.
* Proof of the existence's jubeat jacket shows Blue Repika, while the REFLEC BEAT jacket shows Blue Lupica.
** Proof of the existence uses its jubeat jacket in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
* Proof of the existence received a brand-new BEGINNER chart in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA.
** This chart was removed in [[AC Rootage|beatmania IIDX 26 Rootage]].
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Proof of the existence was revived on July 19th, 2018.
* Proof of the existence [ 2 ] is one of the unlocks of jubeat festo's ''T-emo STORE''. It can be purchased with 200 T-emo from November 5th to December 3rd, 2018.
** It could be purchased again with 150 T-emo from January 7th to February 4th, 2019, and from January 6th to February 3rd, 2020.
** In jubeat Ave. and beyond the Ave., it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* Proof of the existence is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.4''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.4).
* Proof of the existence's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Proof of the existence is the ''LUMINOUS'' unlock of DanceDanceRevolution WORLD's GALAXY BRAVE unlock event. It can be unlocked from May 7th, 2026.

