* アキネイション is one of BeatStream アニムトライヴ's hidden songs. It can be unlocked via ''Takahashi-san no okurodashi'' (タカハシサンのお蔵出し).
* アキネイション is a song part of the [[POLICY BREAK]] event. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked in the SOUND VOLTEX series, please see the event page.
** From January 18th, 2018 in [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]], it can be purchased with BLOCKs instead.
* アキネイション was added as a purchasable song for 1000 lumina in pop'n music éclale's ''Star Factory'' on July 21st, 2016 as part of the ''BeaSt pop'n tanabata matsuri'' (ビースト ポップン 七夕まつり) event. To purchase it, you have to play [[Pa-Pi-Pu-Yeah!|パ→ピ→プ→Yeah!]].
** In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, アキネイション displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
** As of September 28th, 2017 in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
* アキネイション marks beatMARIO's first appearance in the pop'n music series.
* アキネイション is automatically unlocked in jubeat Qubell from March 23rd, 2017 by having unlocked it in BeatStream アニムトライヴ before February 13th, 2017, as part of Phase 5 of the ''BeatStream no ano kyokutachi ga jubeat demo asobechau!'' (BeatStreamのあの曲達がjubeatでも遊べちゃう！) event.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* アキネイション could be unlocked in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course from August 5th, 2020 through August 31st, 2020 by playing INFINITE at least once during that time frame.
** In [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]], it could be unlocked via [[CS SDVX EG/BLASTER GATE|BLASTER GATE]] from August 24th, 2022 through September 25th, 2022.
* アキネイション's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat clan ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* アキネイション is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from December 25th, 2025, by purchasing '''BEMANI SELECTION music pack vol.4''' (BEMANI SELECTION楽曲パック vol.4).
* アキネイション's BeatStream music video eliminates any on-screen dancers in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX.
* アキネイション is one of DanceDanceRevolution WORLD's ''EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD'' songs. It can be unlocked from August 6th, 2026.
* アキネイション is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.7''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.7).

