== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 明鏡止水 marks the first collaboration between Asaki and Tomosuke Funaki in BEMANI.
* 明鏡止水 is one of the pop'n music 10 preview songs that can be found on [[CS pnm 9|pop'n music 9 CS]].
* Before [[AC pnm 12|pop'n music 12 いろは]], 明鏡止水's BPM was correctly shown as 208-290.
* 明鏡止水 is one of three EXTRA STAGEs new to GUITARFREAKS 11thMIX & drummania 10thMIX, along with [[MODEL DD6]] and [[Orbital Velocity]]. Earning at least 95% Perfects on MODEL DD6 will access [[Onihime|鬼姫]] on ENCORE STAGE, up to the highest difficulty tier played on EXTRA STAGE.
* In the GuitarFreaks & DrumMania and beatmania IIDX series, 明鏡止水's artist is shown as '''TOMOSUKE feat. あさき'''.
* 明鏡止水 was performed at ''THE GITADO LIVE -BEMANI 10th Anniversary memorial event-'' concert in 2007.
* 明鏡止水 appears as DLC for [[CS pnm Wii|ポップンミュージック]], in the '''中級インストセット''' pack.
* 明鏡止水 is one of the ''SET LIST'' Revival Songs in GuitarFreaksXG3 & DrumManiaXG3.  It can be unlocked by clearing its respective SET LIST in the Set List Mode.
* 明鏡止水 received an EASY chart on December 12th, 2012 in [[AC pnm Sunny Park|pop'n music Sunny Park]], replacing its old 5-Buttons chart.
* 明鏡止水 could be unlocked in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper as part of the 7th Set (Users' SELECTION) of the ''BEMANI MUSIC FOCUS'' unlocking system. It ranked 4th overall in number of votes of the 30 possible song choices.
** From September 17th, 2015 onwards, it could be purchased from the REFLEC Shop for 3800 Refle.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased in the Garage for 20 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was playable by default.
* 明鏡止水 received a new jacket in the REFLEC BEAT series.
* 明鏡止水 is one of the Phase 1 unlockable songs of the ''Mystery Line'' event of beatmania IIDX 23 copula. It could be unlocked from April 27th, 2016.
** 明鏡止水 uses its original video from the original GuitarFreaks & DrumMania series as its video.
** In [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], its charts can be purchased with [[AC SINOBUZ/Kinran no omamori unlocks|Kinran no omamori]] (金襴のお守り) from December 14th, 2016.
** From [[AC CANNON BALLERS|beatmania IIDX 25 CANNON BALLERS]] onwards, it is available by default.
* In the beatmania IIDX series, 明鏡止水's genre is kept in Japanese.
* 明鏡止水's title uses a different font for the song title since beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], 明鏡止水 was revived on April 5th, 2018.
* 明鏡止水 received brand-new MASTER charts in [[AC GD EXCHAIN|GITADORA EXCHAIN]].
* 明鏡止水 is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.2's ''Minori no sato-kudamono batake-'' (実りの里-くだもの畑-) event. It could be unlocked from November 29th to December 19th, 2018 by collecting 126 stamps.
** It could be unlocked again from March 21st to April 3rd, 2019.
** It could be unlocked again from October 3rd to 16th, 2019.
** In [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]], it can be unlocked from June 11th, 2020 from the [[AC NST Op.3/Old Hidden Songs|ノスタルジアFORTE&Op.2 イベント]] section at the Episode selection screen.
* Upon its addition to ノスタルジア Op.2, 明鏡止水 was included in the ''NOSTALGIA Original'' (ノスタルジアオリジナル) genre in-game. This was corrected on December 13th, 2018.
* 明鏡止水's EX chart was re-rated in [[AC pnm peace|pop'n music peace]] on March 5th, 2019.
* 明鏡止水 is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.11''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.11).
* 明鏡止水 (CLASSIC) is one of the unlocks of [[AC GD NEX+AGE|GITADORA NEX+AGE]]'s ''GITADORA wo tomodachi to issho ni play shiyou!! Campaign'' (GITADORAを友達と一緒にプレーしよう!!キャンペーン). It could be unlocked from July 8th to August 2nd, 2020.
** It could be unlocked again from December 2nd, 2020 to January 3rd, 2021.
** As of [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is available by default.
* 明鏡止水 was added to [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] on May 5th, 2021 as the May 2021 Monthly Bonus Song.
** From May 4th, 2022, it can be unlocked via Ticket Quest after purchasing the song with two ''Lively Tickets'' (Livelyチケット)
* 明鏡止水 and its CLASSIC charts are available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HISTORY PACK vol.6''' (コナステ GITADORA HISTORYパック vol.6).
* 明鏡止水 is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from June 19th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.pop'n music vol.1''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.pop'n music vol.1).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, 明鏡止水 can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From June 30th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, it is available by default for all players.
* In the DanceDanceRevolution series, 明鏡止水 features a modified widescreen version of its GuitarFreaks & DrumMania video, which consists of the original GuitarFreaks & DrumMania video tiled three times across the screen.
** In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, 明鏡止水's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.

