== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 霖が哭く is the sixth unlockable song in jubeat prop's ARENA MODE, unlockable from October 12th to October 18th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** It could also be unlocked in jubeat festo from June 23rd to July 13th, 2021 as part of the ''Stamp Challenge'' unlocking system, by obtaining 9 stamps.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* 霖が哭く marks Daichi Watanabe's first jubeat original song under his Power Of Nature alias.
* According to early data builds of [[AC pnm Sunny Park|pop'n music Sunny Park]], a jazz song by Daichi Watanabe under the Power Of Nature alias (possibly an early version of 霖が哭く) was supposed to appear in that game.
* 霖が哭く first appeared as a new song in jubeat plus' CHALLENGE SCRATCH. It was later included in the jubeat plus prop pack 5.
* 霖が哭く was one of the qualifying round songs in [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|The 6th KONAMI Arcade Championship]] for jubeat Qubell.
* 霖が哭く is one of the ''NAVI-kun to tabi wo shiyou!'' (ナビくんと旅をしよう！) unlockable songs of pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢. It can be unlocked from July 20th, 2017.
** From August 20th, 2018, it is available by default.
** In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, 霖が哭く displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* 霖が哭く is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.2's ''Minori no sato-yasai batake-'' (実りの里-やさい畑-) event. It could be unlocked from November 15th to December 5th, 2018 by collecting 126 stamps.
** It could be unlocked again from March 14th to 27th, 2019.
** It could be unlocked again from September 26th to October 10th, 2019.
** In [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]], it can be unlocked from June 11th, 2020 from the [[AC NST Op.3/Old Hidden Songs|ノスタルジアFORTE&Op.2 イベント]] section at the Episode selection screen.
* Upon its addition to ノスタルジア Op.2, 霖が哭く was included in the ''NOSTALGIA Original'' (ノスタルジアオリジナル) genre in-game. This was corrected on December 13th, 2018.
* 霖が哭く's HYPER and EX charts were re-rated in [[AC pnm peace|pop'n music peace]] on March 5th, 2019.
* 霖が哭く's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* 霖が哭く is one of the unlocks of the [[BEMANI noryosai 2026|BEMANI納涼祭2026]] event. It could be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD from June 18th, 2026 to August 17th, 2026.

