== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* シャムシールの舞 is a hidden song in pop'n music 14 FEVER!. To unlock it:
** Play a song with the word "dance" in either its genre or song name. You must also clear this song with the OJAMAs Dance (ダンス) and From beginning to end (最初から最後まで), or setting the Dance OJAMA to ON for the entire song.
** For your SECOND STAGE, play a song of equal or lower difficulty to that of the previous song. (The same song can be used to fulfill this requirement.)
** You must also fulfill one of the following criteria as well with the above two songs:
*** SCORE of FIRST STAGE > SCORE of SECOND STAGE
*** GREAT count of FIRST STAGE > GREAT count of SECOND STAGE (or COOL if in Cho Challenge Mode).
*** BAD number of FIRST STAGE < BAD number of SECOND STAGE
** If these conditions are met, シャムシールの舞 will be playable on FINAL STAGE.
*** As of July 5th, 2006, シャムシールの舞 is unlocked for everyone to play.
* シャムシールの舞 is the first use of TOMOSUKE's Zektbach alias in pop'n music.
** It also marks the only time when his Zektbach alias has been written in Japanese as ゼクトバッハ.
*** However, シャムシールの舞's jacket, and the beatmania IIDX and DanceDanceRevolution series display '''Zektbach''' instead of "ゼクトバッハ" as the artist name. It is also sorted under the Z letter as "Zektbach" in the pop'n music series.
* シャムシールの舞's title is translated as "Shamshir Dance".
* シャムシールの舞's pop'n music charts were created by TOMOSUKE himself [https://mond.how/ja/topics/2xyfcbncwcat294].
* In [[CS pnm mobile|코나미 팝픈뮤직]], シャムシールの舞's title was changed to '''샴시르의 춤''' ("shamshir-ui chum").
** However, the 코나미 팝픈뮤직 official site sorted it as '''shamshirdance'''.
* 샴시르의 춤 was available on 코나미 팝픈뮤직 as downloadable content from January 22nd, 2009.
* A brand-new video for シャムシールの舞 appears on a bonus DVD included on ''The Epic of Zektbach -FRAGMENTS OF ARIA TE'LARIA-'' bundle, alongside videos for [[L'erisia(Primal Logic)]] and [[Raison d'etre~kousa suru shukumei~|Raison d'être～交差する宿命～]]. This video is not used in the beatmania IIDX series.
* シャムシールの舞 appears as DLC for [[CS pnm Wii|ポップンミュージック]], in the '''上級フィーバーセット'''.
* シャムシールの舞 is one of the Refle unlockable songs in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. It can be purchased from the Reflec Shop for 1000 Refle, after clearing the song in the ''Zektbach Test'' (Zektbach検定) in REFLEC Dojo, which was added on July 4th, 2014.
** Since August 22nd, 2014, it is automatically available for all to purchase.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], シャムシールの舞 is playable by default.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], シャムシールの舞 was revived on December 20th, 2018.
* シャムシールの舞 received UPPER charts in [[AC pnm peace|pop'n music peace]] as one of the unlocks of the ''pop'n time trip'' (ポップンタイムトリップ) event. It could be unlocked from August 7th, 2019 to February 19th, 2020 by filling out 4 stamps of the second Extra card.
** From December 24th, 2020 in [[AC pnm Kaimei Riddles|pop'n music 解明リドルズ]], it is available by default.
* シャムシールの舞 is part of the [[Maishuu! Ichika no chou BEMANI rush 2020]] (毎週！いちかの超BEMANIラッシュ2020) event. It could be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 27 HEROIC VERSE from September 16th, 2020 until October 28th, 2020.
** From February 14th, 2022, it could be purchased in [[AC CastHour|beatmania IIDX 29 CastHour]] with [[AC CastHour/Archive Links|Archive Links]] (アーカイブリンク).
** As of [[AC RESIDENT|beatmania IIDX 30 RESIDENT]], it is available by default.
* シャムシールの舞's genre is kept in Japanese in beatmania IIDX.
* When シャムシールの舞 is played in beatmania IIDX, the arcade LED ticker displays "SHAMSHIR DANCE".
* Upon its debut, シャムシールの舞(UPPER) did not use its original chart's background. This was fixed in [[AC pnm UniLab|pop'n music UniLab]].
* シャムシールの舞 could be unlocked in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] from November 2nd, 2022 to January 4th, 2023 as a ''Kikan gentei quest'' (期間限定クエスト).
** From November 1st, 2023, it can be unlocked via Ticket Quest after purchasing the song with two ''Lively Tickets'' (Livelyチケット)
* シャムシールの舞 appears as selectable background music in ''CHASE CHASE JOKERS'' (チェイスチェイスジョーカーズ).
* シャムシールの舞 is available in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS pop'n music Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS pop'n music セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* シャムシールの舞 is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX from March 13th, 2025, by purchasing '''BEMANI SELECTION music pack vol.3''' (BEMANI SELECTION楽曲パック vol.3).
* シャムシールの舞(UPPER) received an EASY chart in [[AC pnm Jam&Fizz|pop'n music Jam&Fizz]] on April 22nd, 2025.
* シャムシールの舞 is one of DanceDanceRevolution WORLD's ''EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD'' songs. It can be unlocked from December 4th, 2025.

