** Absolute zero is the lowest theoretically possible temperature, measured as 0 degrees in the Kelvin scale.
* [[Hiyuki-chan]] appears in 絶対零度's jacket.
* 絶対零度 can be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS from September 15th, 2016 to March 7th, 2018 as part of the [[Agetta moratta]] (アゲッタモラッタ) event.
* 絶対零度 is available in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course and [[CS SDVX EG|EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from January 8th, 2020, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.7''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.7).
* 絶対零度 is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from June 19th, 2025, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.36''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.36).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, 絶対零度 can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From June 30th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, it is available by default for all players.

