== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* MEGALOVANIA was added to DanceDanceRevolution A3 on May 19th, 2022.
* MEGALOVANIA originates from the video game ''UNDERTALE''.
** Two early versions of the song appeared in the ''EarthBound Halloween Hack'' (a ROM hack of ''Earthbound'' for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System) and the web novel Homestuck, respectively.
* MEGALOVANIA is the first song in the DanceDanceRevolution series to include Shock Arrows outside of the CHALLENGE difficulty.
** Its Double CHALLENGE chart has the largest [[GROOVE RADAR]] of any DanceDanceRevolution chart with a total size of 776 (196 STREAM, 112 VOLTAGE, 245 AIR, 104 FREEZE, and 119 CHAOS).
*** It also has the highest AIR rating of any chart, with 245, beating the previous record of 224 set by [[POSSESSION (20th Anniversary Mix)]]'s Double CHALLENGE chart from [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]].
*** With 266 Shock Arrows, it also has the highest number of Shock Arrows of any chart.
** Its CHALLENGE charts are the first charts rated Level 18 in the series to be available by default upon release.
* MEGALOVANIA features gameplay footage from the Japanese localization of ''UNDERTALE'' in its video.
** Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], MEGALOVANIA's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
** The same video was also later used in the GuitarFreaks & DrumMania series.
* MEGALOVANIA's Single CHALLENGE chart had a section where players had to jump and hold both arrows while holding a third arrow, creating a "hand". This was fixed on May 31st, 2022 by shortening the length of the Freeze Arrow.
* MEGALOVANIA also appears in TAITO's ''GROOVE COASTER'', BANDAI NAMCO's ''太鼓の達人'', and SEGA's ''CHUNITHM''.
* MEGALOVANIA was added to GITADORA HIGH-VOLTAGE on August 10th, 2022.
** Alongside the addition of MEGALOVANIA, the ''[*GITADORA ni UNDERTALE ga arawareta]'' (【＊GITADORAに UNDERTALEが あらわれた】) event started on the same date and ended on October 10th, 2022, allowing the players to unlock UNDERTALE-themed customization items by obtaining 30 points. Each song played awarded one point, but playing LONG version songs and MEGALOVANIA awarded two points instead.
* MEGALOVANIA was added to SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR and SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ on September 15th, 2022.
* By moving the knobs during gameplay in the SOUND VOLTEX series, the heart in the background of MEGALOVANIA will move as well. This trait is shared with the other UNDERTALE songs in SOUND VOLTEX.
* The effector credits for MEGALOVANIA reference one of Sans' lines before his battle in ''UNDERTALE''; "on days like these, kids like you should be burning in hell".
* MEGALOVANIA was added to pop'n music UniLab on December 22nd, 2022.
* Despite being a licensed arrangement, MEGALOVANIA was not included in the TV/J-POP category in pop'n music UniLab until April 11th, 2023.
* MEGALOVANIA was added to ノスタルジア Op.3 on April 27th, 2023.
** Its Real chart can be unlocked through the ''UNDERTALE'' event, available from the same date as well.
* MEGALOVANIA was added to DANCERUSH STARDOM on July 27th, 2023.
* MEGALOVANIA is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 10th, 2023, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.UNDERTALE''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.UNDERTALE).
* MEGALOVANIA was added to [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] on November 8th, 2023.
* The BPM changes from MEGALOVANIA's BEGINNER and BASIC charts were removed in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD on June 10th, 2025.
** Its Double BASIC chart was also slightly modified.
** These changes were also applied to DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX on June 17th, 2025.
* MEGALOVANIA was added to jubeat beyond the Ave. on April 30th, 2026.
** It was first featured in the [[AC jb U'nit|jubeat U'nit]] location test, five days prior to its addition to beyond the Ave..

