* Deep tenDon Reflex is one of the default EXTRA EXCLUSIVE LEVEL 1 songs of DanceDanceRevolution A3. It could only be played on EXTRA STAGE.
** As of EXTRA EXCLUSIVE LEVEL 3 (February 13th, 2023), it is playable by default.
* Deep tenDon Reflex marks Coyaan's debut in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
* The character in Deep tenDon Reflex's jacket is named Kon Amato (天戸 紺) [https://x.com/DDR_573/status/1914937591209840956].
** Deep tenDon Reflex's jacket artist is uncredited in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* Deep tendon reflex is the medical term for an involuntary reflex in a tendon. Also, "tendon" (天丼) refers to a rice bowl dish with tempura on top of rice, hence why Kon Amato has a tendon placed on top of her head in Deep tenDon Reflex's jacket.
* Deep tenDon Reflex received CHALLENGE charts in DanceDanceRevolution A3 on June 22nd, 2022.
* Deep tenDon Reflex's CHALLENGE charts are noted for their pattern where Freeze Arrows in the same position start and end extremely close together (separated by a 64th beat), giving the impression of one long, multi-hit Freeze Arrow.
* Deep tenDon Reflex is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 6th, 2023, by purchasing '''BPL S2 music pack vol.6''' (BPL S2楽曲パック vol.6).
* Deep tenDon Reflex is one of the unlocks of the [[BEMANI PRO LEAGUE -SEASON 3- Triple Tribe]] Part 2 event. It could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from February 15th to April 21st, 2024 for Valkyrie model cabinets only.
** Since September 11th, 2025, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* Deep tenDon Reflex being crossed over marks Coyaan's first appearance in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* Deep tenDon Reflex is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 13th, 2025, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.3''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.3).
* In the pop'n music series, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Deep tenDon Reflex displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* Deep tenDon Reflex's LIGHT chart was re-rated in pop'n music High☆Cheers!!'s AMUSEMENT EXPO 2025 location test.
* Deep tenDon Reflex is one of the unlocks of the [[BEMANI noryosai 2026|BEMANI納涼祭2026]] event. It could be unlocked in ポラリスコード from June 18th, 2026 to August 17th, 2026.
** Deep tenDon Reflex is the first DanceDanceRevolution song to cross over to ポラリスコード.
* Deep tenDon Reflex is available in beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020) by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS DanceDanceRevolution Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS DanceDanceRevolution セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* In the beatmania IIDX series, Deep tenDon Reflex's genre is kept in Japanese.

