== Trivia ==
* Flip Flap is unlocked in REFLEC BEAT limelight by reaching the final part of Glass Stage 4-3.
** In [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]], it is unlocked by reaching the end of Stage 3 of Pastel Adventure (パステルアドベンチャー) in limelight Mountain. 
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Flip Flap was available by default.
* Flip Flap is the second song of [[Lincle LINK]] 5 to be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle. It becomes available once Q-pro Level 25 has been reached.
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], it has been automatically unlocked as of May 14th, 2014 by using an [[e-amusement|eAMUSEMENT]] PASS.
* Flip Flap and [[SA.YO.NA.RA. SUPER STAR]] are the first songs to have charts containing Backspin Scratches without Charge Notes.
** It is also the first song with Backspin Scratches found only in the Double Play charts.
* Flip Flap was one of the preliminary round songs in the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2012]] for REFLEC BEAT limelight.
* Flip Flap is one of the ''bistro saucer'' 7th Set unlocks of jubeat saucer. It could be unlocked from May 1st to 31st, 2013.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** It could also be unlocked in jubeat festo from March 24th to April 13th, 2021 as part of the ''Stamp Challenge'' unlocking system, by obtaining 6 stamps.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* Flip Flap received a SPECIAL chart in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! on June 18th, 2014. It could be bought in the Reflec Shop for 1200 Refle, after clearing the chart in the 2ND ROUND of the kors k Test (kors k検定) in REFLEC Dojo, which was added on the same day.
** From August 22nd, 2014, it could be purchased without prerequisites.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased from the Garage for 8 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked by clearing its HARD chart a specific number of times, depending on the grade obtained on it (AAA+: 1 time, AAA: 2 times, AA: 3 times, A or lower: 5 times).
* Flip Flap's SPECIAL chart can be purchased in REFLEC BEAT plus since December 22nd, 2016.
* Flip Flap is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.1''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.1).
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Flip Flap was revived on November 2nd, 2017.
* Flip Flap's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat clan ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Flip Flap could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from March 30th to May 8th, 2022, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 1 stamp.
** Since January 30th, 2024, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* Flip Flap's BPM was incorrectly displayed as 172 in the jubeat series. This was fixed in jubeat Ave. on September 13th, 2022.
* Flip Flap is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from April 24th, 2023, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.1''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.1).
** By purchasing this pack with an active subscription, Flip Flap can be played in DanceDanceRevolution A3.
** From April 30th, 2024 in DanceDanceRevolution A3, it is available by default for all players.
* Flip Flap is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from October 11th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).

