== Trivia ==
* Playing With Fire is one of the unlockable songs of the first Phase of REFLEC BEAT colette -Spring-'s ''Pastel Adventure'' colette Garden unlocking system. To obtain it, you must have bloomed any two different seeds of the Cherry-shaped Seed (桜形のたね), the Pointed Seed (とがったたね) or the Fairy Seed (妖精のたね).
** From REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Playing With Fire was playable by default.
* Playing With Fire is a song part of the [[POLICY BREAK]] event. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked in the SOUND VOLTEX series, please see the event page.
** Playing With Fire being crossed over marks Kosuke Saito's first appearance in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
** From September 12th, 2019 in [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]] and from October 2nd, 2019 in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]], it can be purchased with PCB instead.
* Playing With Fire was used as the main background music during the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2013]] broadcasting.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Playing With Fire was revived on March 1st, 2018.
* Playing With Fire is one of the Second Library unlocks of beatmania IIDX 26 Rootage's ''The Bibliotheca of Mirage'' (蜃気楼の図書館) event. It can be unlocked from January 28th, 2019.
** From February 6th, 2020, its charts can be purchased in [[AC HEROIC VERSE|beatmania IIDX 27 HEROIC VERSE]] with [[AC HEROIC VERSE/Tone discharger|Tone discharger]] (トーンディスチャージャー).
** As of [[AC BISTROVER|beatmania IIDX 28 BISTROVER]], it is available by default.
* Playing With Fire was added to [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]] on February 25th, 2021.
* Playing With Fire is available in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.18''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.18).
* Playing With Fire is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from April 24th, 2023, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.2''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.2).
** By purchasing this pack with an active subscription, Playing With Fire can be played in DanceDanceRevolution A3.
** From April 30th, 2024 in DanceDanceRevolution A3, it is available by default for all players.
* Playing With Fire is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from September 19th, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).

