== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* spring pony is part of S-C-U's "Animal" song series.

== Trivia ==
* spring pony is one of jubeat saucer's ''Only Now Songs'' (いまだけ楽曲). It could be unlocked from December 12th to 19th, 2012 as part of the ''pop'n music Sunny Park × jubeat saucer'' event.
** From December 20th, 2012, it could be unlocked via ''bistro saucer''.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** It could also be unlocked in jubeat festo from March 24th to April 13th, 2021 as part of the ''Stamp Challenge'' unlocking system, by obtaining 3 stamps.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* spring pony was added to pop'n music Sunny Park on December 12th, 2012, as part of the ''Sunny Park kaien kinen! pop'n music Sunny Park × jubeat saucer'' (サニーパーク開園記念！pop'n music Sunny Park × jubeat saucer) event.
* spring pony is Shigeharu Saeki's first original song for pop'n music since [[AC pnm 16|pop'n music 16 PARTY♪]]'s [[Konamonya ninjouka|こなもん屋人情歌]].
** It also marks his first use of the S-C-U alias in pop'n music.
* rolly, the character of [[Over the hill]], makes a cameo on Roly-Pony's FEVER animation.
** [[Mimi]] and [[Nyami]] make cameos on Roly-Pony's WIN and FEVER WIN animations.
*** Mimi, Nyami and Roly-Pony are drawn in the same kind of art style of the jubeat saucer characters on Roly-Pony's FEVER WIN animation.
* According to shio, she worked directly with the jubeat team in designing Roly-Pony.
** She also notes that she misinterpreted the spring in spring pony's name, thinking it referred to the season as opposed to the character being a horse with a spring. This is why spring pony's character and background have a spring motif.
*** Fittingly, spring pony was later added to REFLEC BEAT colette -Spring- (see below).
* spring pony can be unlocked in REFLEC BEAT colette -Spring- from April 1st, 2013 as part of the [[Pastel-kun to Smith-shi no RUNRUN marathon!]] (パステルくんとスミス氏のRUNRUNマラソン!) crossover event with jubeat saucer. It is the first unlockable song of the 1st Meeting, after Smith completes 5 laps around the track.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], spring pony was playable by default.
* An early screenshot of the [[AC BST|BeatStream]] song selection screen shows spring pony as part of the song list. However, the song did not appear in the original BeatStream, only in its sequel (see below) [https://www.4gamer.net/games/247/G024776/20140213116/SS/005.jpg].
* spring pony was added to BeatStream アニムトライヴ on March 17th, 2016, as part of the ''BeaSt selection! Haru no Nyan matsuri!'' (ビーストせれくしょん! 春のにゃん祭り!) event.
* spring pony's EASY chart was re-rated in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]] on March 29th, 2017.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], spring pony was revived on January 9th, 2020.
* spring pony is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.6''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.6).
* spring pony's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* spring pony's pop'n music Lively ratings were adjusted to its [[AC pnm UniLab|UniLab]] ratings on October 31st, 2022.
* spring pony is one of DanceDanceRevolution A3's ''EXTRA SAVIOR A3'' songs. It can be unlocked from March 23rd, 2023 for 20th anniversary model cabinets, and from March 27th, 2023 for regular cabinets.
** As of [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], it is available by default.
* spring pony is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from September 19th, 2024, by purchasing '''BEMANI SELECTION music pack vol.2''' (BEMANI SELECTION楽曲パック vol.2).

