== Trivia ==
* Vallisneria is a genus of freshwater aquatic plants.
* VALLIS-NERIA was made playable in REFLEC BEAT limelight on June 27th, 2012, as part of its summer update.
* VALLIS-NERIA is a song part of the [[POLICY BREAK]] event. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked in the SOUND VOLTEX series, please see the event page.
** From September 12th, 2019 in [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]] and from October 2nd, 2019 in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]], it can be purchased with PCB instead.
** It is the first BEMANI song to be crossed over to the SOUND VOLTEX series without being remixed.
* VALLIS-NERIA appears in beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro as part of the [[Q-pro, Mimi, Nyami & Pastel-kun no minna de uchuu sensou!!]] (クプロ・ミミニャミ・パステルくんのみんなで宇宙戦争!!) unlock event, which started on July 29th, 2013.
** It is the only song of the event that received a unique background video.
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]] and [[AC PENDUAL|beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL]], it could be unlocked through the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki]] (発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡) event.
*** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, it is playable by default.
* VALLIS-NERIA can be unlocked in jubeat saucer from November 13th, 2013 as part of the [[Pastel-kun to Smith-shi no RUNRUN marathon!]] (パステルくんとスミス氏のRUNRUNマラソン!) crossover event with [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]]. It can be unlocked by playing 4 games of REFLEC BEAT colette.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from May 1st, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
* To unlock VALLIS-NERIA in jubeat plus, you must have purchased the three RUNRUNマラソン！ packs in jubeat plus. Then, you can download the song by tapping the Gift button at the Store.
** Since August 5th, 2016, it can be downloaded without any requisites.
* VALLIS-NERIA is one of the songs featured on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5-IrAGbjKcA BEMANI SONGS ～Best of REFLEC BEAT～] video.
* VALLIS-NERIA received a BEGINNER chart in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL.
* VALLIS-NERIA could be unlocked in MÚSECA 1+1/2 from August 10th to November 20th, 2016 as part of the ''DJ YOSHITAKA-ten'' (DJ YOSHITAKA展) event, by playing MÚSECA 1+1/2 six times.
** Its Green chart is available by default from June 26th, 2018 for MÚSECA 1+1/2 machines with an offline kit (its Orange and Red charts have to be unlocked with COLORIS, though).
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], VALLIS-NERIA was revived on January 19th, 2017.
** Its WHITE HARD chart could be unlocked through a quest in Reflesia Mode (リフレシアモード) from January 19th to February 1st, 2017.
*** It could be unlocked again from March 9th to 22nd, 2017.
*** As of March 23rd, 2017, it is available by default.
* VALLIS-NERIA is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.4''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.4).
* An early screenshot of the [[AC BST|BeatStream]] song selection screen shows VALLIS-NERIA as part of the song list. However, the song never appeared in that BEMANI series [https://www.4gamer.net/games/247/G024776/20140213116/SS/005.jpg].
* VALLIS-NERIA [ 2 ] is one of the unlocks of jubeat festo's ''T-emo STORE''. It could be purchased with 300 T-emo from December 2nd, 2019 to January 6th, 2020.
** It could be purchased again with 150 T-emo from June 1st to July 6th, 2020, and from September 7th to October 5th, 2020.
** In jubeat Ave. and beyond the Ave., it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* VALLIS-NERIA could be unlocked in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course from December 2nd, 2020 through December 31st, 2020 by playing INFINITE at least once during that time frame.
** In [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]], it could be unlocked via [[CS SDVX EG/BLASTER GATE|BLASTER GATE]] from March 1st through March 31st, 2023.
* VALLIS-NERIA's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* VALLIS-NERIA and VALLIS-NERIA [ 2 ] were added to jubeat (2021)'s normal mode on March 30th, 2022.
* VALLIS-NERIA is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX from August 10th, 2022, by pre-ordering the DanceDanceRevolution Dedicated Controller (DanceDanceRevolution 専用コントローラ).
** By pre-ordering the controller while having an active subscription, VALLIS-NERIA could be played in DanceDanceRevolution A3.
** From August 28th, 2023 in DanceDanceRevolution A3, it is available by default for all players.
* In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX and A3, VALLIS-NERIA's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.
* VALLIS-NERIA is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Sasotte otoku! Polaris Chord fukyou campaign'' (誘ってお得！ポラリスコード布教キャンペーン) event. It can be unlocked from March 27th to May 19th, 2025.
* VALLIS-NERIA appears in SEGA's [[:silentblue:CHUNITHM:LUMINOUS|CHUNITHM LUMINOUS]].
* VALLIS-NERIA's EXCEED chart is the ''Honoo no tsubasa'' (本能の翼) EXTRACK song of [[AC SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR]]'s ''VARIANT GATE'' unlock system. It can be unlocked from June 26th, 2025 after having unlocked the EXCEED charts of [[I'm so Happy]], [[Koi hadou? Moro hadou OK houteishiki!!|恋はどう？モロ◎波動OK☆方程式！！]], and [[Elpis|ΕΛΠΙΣ]].
** A special background is displayed for the EXCEED chart, with DJ YOSHITAKA as he appears in the song's jacket.
** During the latter part of the chart, the lane rotates and stops at an inverted position. This is done twice.
* VALLIS-NERIA's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.
* VALLIS-NERIA received CHALLENGE charts in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], which are unlockable through ''EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD'' from November 5th, 2026 after having unlocked ''all'' BOSS RUSH CHALLENGE charts.
** In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, these charts are playable by default from November 5th, 2026.

