== Trivia ==
* White Stream is a song part of the [[Ichika no gochamaze Mix UP!]] (いちかのごちゃまぜMix UP！) event. It could be unlocked in GITADORA HIGH-VOLTAGE, [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], and SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from November 1st, 2022 to January 11th, 2023.
** In GITADORA FUZZ-UP, it is also one of the unlocks of the ''Daishuugou atsumare together! GITADORA All Star GIG!'' (大集合あつまれトゥギャザー！GITADORAオールスターGIG！) event. It can be unlocked from December 13th, 2023.
*** In [[AC GD GALAXY WAVE|GITADORA GALAXY WAVE]], it can be unlocked in the ''Daihousou awasero channel! GALAXY MUSIC PARADE!'' (大放送あわせろチャンネル！GALAXY MUSIC PARADE！) event from December 11th, 2024.
*** In [[AC GD GALAXY WAVE DELTA|GITADORA GALAXY WAVE DELTA]], it can also be unlocked through 大放送あわせろチャンネル！GALAXY MUSIC PARADE！ from April 10th, 2025.
** Since January 30th, 2024, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* White Stream marks Alicemetix's first appearance in the GuitarFreaks & DrumMania and SOUND VOLTEX series.
* [[GRACE]] and [[OTOBEAR]] appear on White Stream's jacket.
* White Stream is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK vol.3''' (コナステ GITADORA 特別企画セレクションパック vol.3).
* White Stream is one of jubeat beyond the Ave.'s BONUS TUNE songs. It can be unlocked for regular play since March 1st, 2024, by playing the song thrice as a BONUS TUNE.
* White Stream is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 21st, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.22''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.22).
* White Stream is one of DanceDanceRevolution A3's ''EXTRA SAVIOR A3'' songs. It can be unlocked from April 4th, 2024 for 20th anniversary model cabinets, and from April 8th, 2024 for regular cabinets.
** As of [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], it is available by default.
* White Stream is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]] as an EXTRA STAGE song from April 8th, 2024.
** It is available in GRAND PRIX mode from March 31st, 2025, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.35''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.35).

