== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is one of the unlockable songs of REFLEC BEAT colette -Summer-'s ''Pastel Adventure'' colette Fishing unlocking system.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン was playable by default.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is Tomosuke Funaki's third song under his Kuroneko Dungeon alias, after 量子の海のリントヴルム and 龍と少女とデコヒーレンス.
* In Norse mythology, Laevateinn (or Lævateinn) is a weapon mentioned in the Poetic Edda poem Fjölsvinnsmál.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is unlockable in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL as part of the [[Coca-ColaxBEMANI|Coca-Cola×BEMANI]] event, which began on October 23rd, 2014 and ended on January 22nd, 2015.
** It was unlockable from March 4th, 2015 as part of the [[AC PENDUAL/Qpronicle Chord|Qpronicle Chord]] event.
** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, it is available by default.
* When リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is played on beatmania IIDX, the arcade LED ticker displays "LILIEZE AND HER FIRE DRAGON".
** In REFLEC BEAT +, リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's title and artist were changed to '''lilieze and her fire dragon''' and '''Black Cat Labyrinth''', respectively.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン originally had a generic video in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL. It received its own unique video on January 19th, 2015.
** Maud, the girl who earlier appeared in 龍と少女とデコヒーレンス, appears again in リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's video.
** The following words are written in リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's video:
<center><pre>I feel...

anger
suspicion
discouragement
hatred
desolation</pre></center>
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is one of BeatStream アニムトライヴ's hidden songs. It can be unlocked via ''Takahashi-san no okurodashi'' (タカハシサンのお蔵出し).
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン received RENEWAL charts in [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], unlockable as part of the fifth phase of the ''Pastel-kun to Gakkii Hakase no dokidoki rhythm kenkyujou'' (パステルくんとガッキー博士のドキドキリズム研究所) event. They could be unlocked after assembling the ''Stolen Haunted Pipe Organ'' (取り憑かれたパイプオルガン) instrument.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, these charts were playable by default.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン received a NIGHTMARE chart in BeatStream アニムトライヴ on January 11th, 2017, unlockable via ''BEAST HACKER''.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン was revived on January 19th, 2017.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is one of the ''NAVI-kun to tabi wo shiyou!'' (ナビくんと旅をしよう！) unlockable songs of pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢. It can be unlocked from January 26th, 2017.
** In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
** From April 26th, 2018, it is available by default.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's HYPER chart was re-rated in pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 on December 19th, 2017.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is one of the common unlocks of jubeat festo's ''TARGET MUSIC'' unlock system.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン was added to [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] on October 7th, 2020 as part of the October 2020 Basic Subscription Monthly Songs.
** From January 5th, 2022, it could be purchased with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
** From April 20th, 2022, it is available by default.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is one of DanceDanceRevolution A3's ''EXTRA SAVIOR A3'' songs. It can be unlocked from August 4th, 2022 for 20th anniversary model cabinets, and from August 8th, 2022 for regular cabinets.
** As of [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], it is available by default.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers in DanceDanceRevolution A3 and [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]].
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン was added to SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR on April 13th, 2023.
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from October 11th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from February 14th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3).
** It received brand-new CHALLENGE charts, which become available by purchasing this pack.
** By purchasing this pack with an active subscription, リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's CHALLENGE charts can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From February 27th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, they are available by default for all players.
* In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, リリーゼと炎龍レーヴァテイン's BPM is shown as 200 for all of its difficulties.

