== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 斑咲花 is one of the TEAM BLUE songs part of the [[BEMANI 2021 manatsu no utagassen 5 ban shoubu]] (BEMANI 2021真夏の歌合戦5番勝負) event. It can be unlocked in GITADORA HIGH-VOLTAGE, jubeat festo, SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR, and ノスタルジア Op.3 from August 19th, 2021 until September 30th, 2021.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** In [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR A3'' from August 25th, 2022.
*** As of [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], it is available by default.
** In GITADORA HIGH-VOLTAGE, it could also be unlocked in the ''Kyoku tsuku!! Challenge'' (曲つく!!チャレンジ) event from August 31st to September 25th, 2022.
*** In [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is one of the unlocks of the ''Daishuugou atsumare together! GITADORA All Star GIG!'' (大集合あつまれトゥギャザー！GITADORAオールスターGIG！) event. It can be unlocked from July 12th, 2023.
*** In [[AC GD GALAXY WAVE|GITADORA GALAXY WAVE]], it can be unlocked from August 14th, 2024 through [[DX Challenge]] (DXチャレンジ).
*** In [[AC GD GALAXY WAVE DELTA|GITADORA GALAXY WAVE DELTA]], it can also be unlocked through DXチャレンジ since April 4th, 2025.
** In ノスタルジア Op.3, it could also be unlocked in the ''Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai Vol.V'' (時を巡る音楽祭　Vol.V) event, initially available for unlock from September 1st to 22nd, 2022. For more information on the dates when the event was revived, please see [[AC NST Op.3#Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai|this page]].
*** From August 22nd, 2024, it is permanently available for unlock.
** Since June 1st, 2023, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* 斑咲花 marks dadaco's first appearance in the DanceDanceRevolution, and ノスタルジア series.
** It also marks mami's first appearance in the DanceDanceRevolution, and SOUND VOLTEX series.
* Some of 斑咲花's vocals were recorded at [[Shou Tanaka|七誌]]'s ''Studio KPP'' [http://nanashi0089.com/studio_kpp/works.html].
* 斑咲花 was added to jubeat (2021) on June 29th, 2022.
* 斑咲花 is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HISTORY PACK vol.19''' (コナステ GITADORA HISTORYパック vol.19).
* 斑咲花 is one of the unlocks of pop'n music UniLab's ''Narunaru♪ UniLab jikkenshitsu!'' (なるなる♪ユニラボ実験室!) unlocking system. It could be unlocked from November 17th, 2022 to November 1st, 2023, and from March 14th to April 3rd, 2024.
** In [[AC pnm Jam&Fizz|pop'n music Jam&Fizz]], it can be unlocked in the [[AC pnm Jam&Fizz/Narunaru UniLab jikkenshitsu! Songs|Narunaru♪ UniLab puchi jikkenshitsu!]] (なるなる♪ユニラボプチ実験室!) event from March 13th to April 3rd, 2025, and through [[AC pnm Jam&Fizz/Narunaru UniLab jikkenshitsu! Songs#Puchi MAX|Narunaru♪ UniLab jikkenshitsu! Puchi MAX]] (なるなる♪ユニラボ実験室 プチMAX) from June 12th to July 3rd, 2025, and from September 11th, 2025 onwards.
** As of [[AC pnm High Cheers!!|pop'n music High☆Cheers!!]], it is available by default since December 25th, 2025.
* In the pop'n music series, instead of displaying its character's portrait, 斑咲花 displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* 斑咲花 is available in [[CS NST Konasute|コナステ ノスタルジア]] by purchasing '''Konasute NOSTALGIA Music Pack vol.9''' (コナステ ノスタルジア 楽曲パック vol.9).
* 斑咲花 is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 21st, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.22''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.22).
* 斑咲花 is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from September 26th, 2024, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.31''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.31).

