== Trivia ==
* PANIC HOLIC is a song part of the ''KAC2012 Original Song Contest'' (KAC2012オリジナル楽曲コンテスト). It was added to SOUND VOLTEX BOOTH on November 29th, 2012.
** Its charts can be purchased for 60 BLOCKS for ADVANCED, and 250 BLOCKS for EXHAUST.
** In SOUND VOLTEX II -infinite infection- and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, its ADVANCED and EXHAUST charts can be purchased after having cleared 10 songs.
** Since [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]], these charts can be purchased without any prerequisites.
* PANIC HOLIC is one of the songs in Part 2 of [[FLOOR INFECTION]]. During its periods of availability, it can be unlocked in the REFLEC BEAT series by playing 8 rounds of the corresponding SOUND VOLTEX series game to raise the ''infection level'' to Level 3 MAX. For more information on the dates it can be unlocked, please see the event page.
* PANIC HOLIC marks Akira Michishita's first appearance in REFLEC BEAT.
* PANIC HOLIC received a GRAVITY chart in SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS as part of the [[BLASTER GATE|INFINITE BLASTER]] unlock system. It can be unlocked since the game's release date.
* PANIC HOLIC received new charts upon the revival of the FLOOR INFECTION event in [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]] on March 17th, 2017.
* PANIC HOLIC's BASIC chart was re-rated in REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア on April 12th, 2017.
* PANIC HOLIC is part of the [[Maishuu! Ichika no chou BEMANI rush 2020]] (毎週！いちかの超BEMANIラッシュ2020) event. It could be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution A20 PLUS from September 2nd, 2020 until October 29th, 2020.
** PANIC HOLIC being crossed over marks Akira Michishita's first appearance in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
** From October 21st, 2021, it could be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR PLUS''.
** From [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]] onwards, it is available by default.
* According to Akira Michishita, PANIC HOLIC was submitted to SOUND VOLTEX with the intention of it having charts with BPM changes from 110 to 220 [https://twitter.com/c_show_dtmer/status/1300705204040417280].
** Coincidentally, PANIC HOLIC's DanceDanceRevolution charts have said BPM changes.

