* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD shares similarities with [[THE BLACK KNIGHT]], from [[AC Resort Anthem|beatmania IIDX 18 Resort Anthem]].

== Trivia ==
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD's name derives from the Schwarzschild metric from Albert Einstein's theory of general relativity, which is a solution to the Einstein field equations that describes the gravitational field outside a spherical mass, on the assumption that the electric charge of the mass, the angular momentum of the mass, and the universal cosmological constant are all zero. The solution itself is named after Karl Schwarzschild, who first published it in 1916.
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is L.E.D.'s first REFLEC BEAT original song available as a default song on a REFLEC BEAT release.
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is one of the unlockable crossover songs for beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA on the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event.
** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is playable by default.
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD received a SPECIAL chart in [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]] on January 22nd, 2015, as part of the ''Ura MYSTICAL STRIKE'' (裏MYSTICAL STRIKE) event. To unlock it, you must beat Chimera.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased from the Garage for 8 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it could be unlocked by clearing its HARD chart a specific number of times, depending on the grade obtained on it (AAA+: 1 time, AAA: 2 times, AA: 3 times, A or lower: 5 times).
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is one of the only four brand-new KONAMI originals from REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! that never appeared in [[CS RB plus|REFLEC BEAT plus]], the other three being [[Cattleya]], [[onslaught]], and [[Mikeneko DANCE|三毛猫DANCE]].
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD was revived on October 18th, 2018.
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.7''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.7).
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is one of the ''COURSE TRIAL'' unlocks. It could be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution A20 PLUS by playing the WITHSTAND course once from February 10th to March 2nd, 2022.
** From March 3rd, 2022 onwards, it could be unlocked by playing the aforementioned course multiple times.
** From [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]] onwards, it is available by default.
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from February 14th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.REFLEC BEAT vol.3).
* SCHWARZSCHILD FIELD could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from May 29th to July 7th, 2025, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 6 stamps.
** Since February 12th, 2026 in [[AC SDVX NABLA|SOUND VOLTEX ∇]], it can be purchased with BLOCKs.
