== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is the first song of the ''KONAMI 50th Anniversary Memorial Songs'' event. It was added to all active BEMANI arcade games on March 21st, 2019.
** It was added to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 28th, 2019.
*** It does not appear in the European release of DanceDanceRevolution A.
**** Due to an oversight, it still appears in the demo loop on some machines.
** It was added to beatmania IIDX INFINITAS and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ on April 3rd, 2019.
** 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is the first song to be added to every active BEMANI series simultaneously.
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- originally didn't have its video in DanceDanceRevolution A20, but received it the same day it was added to A.
** Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story-'s music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.
* In pop'n music peace, 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is one of the unlocks of the ''pop'n time trip'' (ポップンタイムトリップ) event. It could be unlocked from March 21st, 2019 to February 19th, 2020 by filling out the KONAMI 50th card.
** As of September 30th, 2020, it is available by default.
* In pop'n music, if the player chooses Nyami [pe-1P] as their character and plays 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story-, the rival character will be Mimi [pe-1P] instead of her.
** Instead of displaying its character's portrait, 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- displays its jacket on the song selection screen from April 23rd, 2019.
* In ノスタルジア, 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is part of the ''Anniversary island'' (アニバーサリーアイランド) event. It can be unlocked by collecting 48 stamps.
** In [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]], it can be unlocked from June 11th, 2020 from the [[AC NST Op.3/Old Hidden Songs|ノスタルジアFORTE&Op.2 イベント]] section at the Episode selection screen.
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- marks the first song in REFLEC BEAT credited to BEMANI Sound Team.
** It also marks the first non-revival addition to REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア in over ''15 months''.
* The SOUND VOLTEX effector credits for 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- reference the [[Wikipedia:Konami Code|KONAMI code]].
* In SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ, 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story-'s VIVID chart appears instead as a GRAVITY chart. It was later changed back to VIVID in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]]
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story-'s jacket artist is uncredited in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK vol.2''' (コナステ GITADORA 特別企画セレクションパック vol.2).
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 7th, 2024, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.30''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.30).
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).
* 50th Memorial Songs -Beginning Story- received a BEGINNER chart in [[AC Pinky Crush|beatmania IIDX 32 Pinky Crush]].
** This chart was added to [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] on December 18th, 2024.

