** In jubeat, it is one of the unlocks of jubeat festo's ''E-emo STORE''. It could be purchased from April 25th to May 27th, 2019 with 200 E-emo.
*** It could be purchased again with 100 T-emo from November 5th to December 2nd, 2019, and from May 7th to July 7th, 2020.
*** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In pop'n music peace, it is one of the unlocks of the ''pop'n time trip'' (ポップンタイムトリップ) event. It could be unlocked from April 25th, 2019 to February 19th, 2020 by filling out the second KONAMI 50th stamp card.
