== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Afterimage d'automne is the ノスタルジア representative song of the [[Ichika no BEMANI touhyou senbatsusen 2019|いちかのBEMANI投票選抜戦2019]] event. It could be unlocked in all participating models from September 12th to October 15th, 2019.
** As of June 25th, 2020, it has been unlocked by default in all participating models.
* Afterimage d'automne is the only song of the いちかのBEMANI投票選抜戦2019 event that does not have a variation in another BEMANI series.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Afterimage d'automne displays its jacket when selected.
* Afterimage d'automne's title is Franglais; "d'automne" is French for "of autumn".
* Afterimage d'automne ranked #1 in the BEMANI Fan Site CHECK!SONGS Monthly Ranking list for September 2019.
* At 232 BPM, Afterimage d'automne is currently the fastest song in the DANCERUSH series.
* Afterimage d'automne can be played in [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]] from February 8th, 2021 as part of the ULTIMATE LEAGUE A3 category.
** As of June 21st, 2023, this has become available to play for subscribers.
* Afterimage d'automne also appears in jubeat (2021)'s plus mode, as part of '''festo pack 1'''.
