* Afterimage d'automne is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from May 2nd, 2022, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.16''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.16).
* Afterimage d'automne is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 6th, 2023, by purchasing '''BPL S2 music pack vol.4''' (BPL S2楽曲パック vol.4).
* Afterimage d'automne is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).

