{{Gallery}}
* This Beat Is..... was featured in the announcement trailer for DanceDanceRevolution A20, along with [[Neverland]].
* This Beat Is..... marks Shoichiro Hirata's first BEMANI original song composition since [[Always]] in [[AC pnm 15|pop'n music 15 ADVENTURE]].
** It also marks his first DanceDanceRevolution original song since [[Fly away -mix del matador-]] in [[CS DDR SuperNOVA NA|DanceDanceRevolution SuperNOVA CS (North America)]].
* This Beat Is..... is the song used in the ''LET'S CHECK YOUR LEVEL!'' feature of [[AC DDR A20 PLUS|DanceDanceRevolution A20 PLUS]] and [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]]. After failing the 1st STAGE, an alternative chart of This Beat Is..... will be played, designed to test the player's skills and recommend a level to play. This feature will not appear when playing with an [[e-amusement]] pass that has cleared a song of Level 7 or higher.
** When playing LET'S CHECK YOUR LEVEL!, its artist is shown as '''適正レベル測定'''.
** LET'S CHECK YOUR LEVEL! is unavailable on the European version of the game.
* This Beat Is..... was added to DANCERUSH STARDOM as part of the ''DANCERUSH STARDOM × DanceDanceRevolution SUMMER DANCE CAMP 2020'' event. It could be unlocked from July 7th to September 7th, 2020, by playing DANCERUSH STARDOM at least once during the event.
** From January 27th, 2021 onwards, it can be purchased with 100 ★.
** From April 17th, 2024, it is available by default.
* This Beat Is..... being crossed over marks Shoichiro Hirata's first appearance in the DANCERUSH series.
* This Beat Is..... is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 4th, 2024, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.27''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.27).
* In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, This Beat Is..... received its difficulty changes from [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] on July 3rd, 2024.
* This Beat Is..... is the third unlock of DANCE aROUND's ''Gauge Unlock Event'' (ゲージアンロックイベント) Part 27. It could be unlocked from August 28th to September 14th, 2024, and from February 26th to March 23rd, 2025.
** From September 10th, 2025, it is available by default.

