== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* Trill auf G is an arrangement of August Wilhelmj's ''Air auf der G-Saite'' (also known as Air on the G-String), which itself is an arrangement of the second movement of Johann Sebastian Bach's ''Orchestral Suite No. 3 in D major, BWV 1068''.
** Unlike TAKA's other Bach arrangements [[No.13]] and [[Ubertreffen]], Trill auf G is not under the "TAKA respect for J.S.B." alias.
* A house remix of Trill auf G, titled [[Trill auf G (DANCERUSH Style)]], can be found in [[AC DRS|DANCERUSH STARDOM]].
* A piano arrangement of Trill auf G, titled [[Trill auf G(NOSTALGIA Style)]], can be found in [[AC NST Op.2|ノスタルジア Op.2]].
* A long version of Trill auf G is included in [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]]'s MUSIC PLAYER.

== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Trill auf G is the beatmania IIDX representative song of the [[Ichika no BEMANI touhyou senbatsusen 2019|いちかのBEMANI投票選抜戦2019]] event. It could be unlocked in all participating models from September 12th to October 15th, 2019.
** As an incentive for beatmania IIDX obtaining the most votes in the event, it was made playable by default by playing with an [[e-amusement]] pass in all games on November 27th, 2019.
** As of June 25th, 2020, it no longer requires an e-amusement pass in all participating models.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Trill auf G displays its jacket when selected.
* MUSIC GAMES HARDCORE is a literal translation of the term "otogecore" (音ゲーコア), often used by music game players to describe high-speed, intensely melodic songs designed for high difficulty in the music game genre.
* Trill auf G can be played in [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]] from February 8th, 2021 as part of the ULTIMATE LEAGUE A1 category.
** As of June 21st, 2023, this has become available to play for subscribers.
* Trill auf G is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HISTORY PACK vol.19''' (コナステ GITADORA HISTORYパック vol.19).
* Trill auf G is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] from January 4th, 2023 after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* Trill auf G is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from May 2nd, 2022, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.16''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.16).
* Trill auf G is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* Trill auf G is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 4th, 2024, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.28''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.28).

