* ミッドナイト☆WAR is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] as part of '''Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK''' (特別企画セレクションパック).
* ミッドナイト☆WAR is available in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.18''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.18).
* ミッドナイト☆WAR is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from May 2nd, 2022, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.16''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.16).
* ミッドナイト☆WAR is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* ミッドナイト☆WAR is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 4th, 2024, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.28''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.28).
** It received brand-new CHALLENGE charts, which become available by purchasing both this and '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.27''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.27).
** By purchasing both packs with an active subscription, ミッドナイト☆WAR's CHALLENGE charts can be played in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]].
** From July 31st, 2025 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, these charts are available by default for all players.
* ミッドナイト☆WAR is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Ichika no online matching event'' (いちかのオンラインマッチングイベント) event. It could be purchased with 130 Ichika's charms (いちかのチャーム) from September 26th to November 1st, 2024.

