== Trivia ==
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- was added to BeatStream, jubeat prop, REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS on April 30th, 2015 as part of the [[BEMANI x TOHO project REITAISAI 2015|BEMANI×TOHO project REITAISAI 2015]] event.
** In BeatStream, it could be unlocked by playing five Touhou Project songs.
*** As of December 3rd, 2015, it has been unlocked by default.
** In jubeat prop, it was originally available as a BONUS MUSIC, and could be unlocked by playing it once, after unlocking [[Russian Caravan Rhapsody]] from April 30th, 2015 to May 14th, 2015.
*** It can be unlocked again as a WEEKLY BONUS MUSIC from May 28th, 2015 onwards.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper, it can be unlocked by playing any BEMANI×TOHO song using the [[Homeneko sensation|ホメ猫☆センセーション]] icon, which is acquired by playing ホメ猫☆センセーション three times.
** In SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, it's available by default.
* The DanceDanceRevolution, jubeat, and REFLEC BEAT series use プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s NOVICE jacket, regardless of the difficulty chosen.
** The BeatStream series uses プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s NOVICE, ADVANCED, and EXHAUST jackets for LIGHT, MEDIUM, and BEAST, respectively.
* Touhou Project character Keine Kamishirasawa appears on プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s jackets.
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- marks Takahiro Fukase's first appearance in the jubeat and DanceDanceRevolution series.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- was revived on April 27th, 2017.
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- is one of DanceDanceRevolution A's ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' 妖しき甘雨の旋律に酔いしれよ songs. It can be unlocked from June 21st, 2018.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from December 9th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.21''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.21).
* プレインエイジア -PHQ remix- is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 7th, 2024, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.Touhou Project vol.5''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.東方Project vol.5).
** It received brand-new CHALLENGE charts, which become available by purchasing both this and '''SPECIAL music pack feat.Touhou Project vol.6''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.東方Project vol.6).
** By purchasing both packs with an active subscription, プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-'s CHALLENGE charts can be played in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]].
*** From August 29th, 2025 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, these charts are available by default for all players.

