== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 千年ノ理 was added to beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL, BeatStream, jubeat prop, pop'n music ラピストリア, REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS on May 14th, 2015 as part of the [[BEMANI x TOHO project REITAISAI 2015|BEMANI×TOHO project REITAISAI 2015]] event.
** In beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL, it is available as an unlockable song on the TOHO REMIX EXPERT COURSE.
*** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, 千年ノ理 is automatically unlocked for everyone to play.
** In BeatStream, it could be unlocked by playing seven Touhou Project songs after unlocking [[Taketori hishou ~ Lunatic Princess (Ryu Remix)|竹取飛翔 ～ Lunatic Princess (Ryu☆Remix)]], and then receiving a mail in ''Takahashi-san Lab.'' with one of the song's charts.
*** As of December 3rd, 2015, it has been unlocked by default.
** In jubeat prop, it was originally available as a BONUS MUSIC, and could be unlocked by playing it once from May 14th, 2015 to May 28th, 2015, after unlocking [[Ayakashi kakushi|妖隠し -あやかしかくし-]].
*** It can be unlocked again as a WEEKLY BONUS MUSIC from May 28th, 2015 onwards.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Emerald STAGE 12 unlocks of jubeat Qubell's ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper, it can be unlocked by playing ten BEMANI×TOHO songs using any BEMANI×TOHO icon (note that you must have previously unlocked [[Plain Asia -PHQ remix-|プレインエイジア -PHQ remix-]] to unlock 千年ノ理).
*** From [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] onwards, 千年ノ理 is playable by default.
** In pop'n music ラピストリア and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, it's available by default.
