== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Angelic Jelly is part of the [[NEW Generation natsu no ryuusei festa 2016]] (NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016) event, a collaboration event involving beatmania IIDX 23 copula, jubeat Qubell, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS.
** In beatmania IIDX 23 copula, it can be unlocked by completing the HAPPY course.
*** As of [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], it is available by default.
** In jubeat Qubell, it is available by default.
** In SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, it could be unlocked by collecting 11 stamps. One stamp is awarded each play session. Its GRAVITY chart could be unlocked via [[BLASTER GATE|INFINITE BLASTER]].
*** From December 15th, 2016, it could be purchased at the SDVX Station.
*** As of [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]], its NOVICE to EXHAUST charts are unlocked by default, while its GRAVITY chart can be unlocked via ''BLASTER GATE''.
* Angelic Jelly marks the debut of t+pazolite in the beatmania IIDX, DanceDanceRevolution, REFLEC BEAT, and pop'n music series.
* Angelic Jelly was added to DanceDanceRevolution A, MÚSECA 1+1/2, pop'n music éclale, and REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2 on October 6th, 2016, as part of the ''NEW Generation ryuusei kakusan festa 2016'' (NEW Generation 流星拡散フェスタ2016) event.
** In DanceDanceRevolution A, it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' one chart at a time, starting from BEGINNER/BASIC and all the way up to EXPERT.
*** Like all the other NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016 songs, Angelic Jelly could not be unlocked in the North American release of DanceDanceRevolution A until December 1st, 2016.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In MÚSECA, pop'n music, and REFLEC BEAT, it is playable by default.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Angelic Jelly displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Angelic Jelly was revived on February 2nd, 2017. 
* Angelic Jelly did not appear on ''any'' BEMANI game's OST until the release of the [[pop'n music Usagi to neko to shounen no yume Original Soundtrack|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 Original Soundtrack]] album, two years after the event.
* Angelic Jelly is available in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course and [[CS SDVX EG|EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 4th, 2020, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.10''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.10).
* Angelic Jelly is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] from May 6th, 2021 after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* Angelic Jelly's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Angelic Jelly is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from November 28th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.11''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.11).
* Angelic Jelly is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.5''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.5).

