** It is the second song in order of the SECRET LIVE revivals.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY could be unlocked in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper as part of the 1st Set ([[Yoshihiro Tagawa|DJ TOTTO]]'s SELECTION) of the ''BEMANI MUSIC FOCUS'' unlocking system.
** From September 17th, 2015 onwards, it could be purchased from the REFLEC Shop for 3800 Refle.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased in the Garage for 20 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was playable by default.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY received a new jacket in the REFLEC BEAT series.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY was supposed to appear in the cancelled game [[Cancelled Games#Karaoke Revolution BEMANI series selection|カラオケレボリューション BEMANIシリーズセレクション]].
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY is one of the songs featured on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pertDK-j6HE BEMANI SONGS ～Best of GITADORA～] video.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY was performed at the ''BEMANI ROCK FES'16'' concert in 2016.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY is one of DanceDanceRevolution A's ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' 恋せよDDRのバレンタイン&ホワイトデー2018 songs. It can be unlocked from February 1st, 2018.
** It also received new charts in DanceDanceRevolution A.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY is one of the [[MISSION BINGO]] unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.2. It can be unlocked in ノスタルジア Op.2 from February 14th, 2019, and in [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]] from February 13th, 2020.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY's Expert chart was re-rated on February 27th, 2019 in ノスタルジア Op.2.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY's difficulty level changes from DanceDanceRevolution A20 were applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY received a Real chart in ノスタルジア Op.3 on February 13th, 2020.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY was revived on March 26th, 2020.
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] as part of the '''GITADORA Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (GITADORA セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* CHOCOLATE PHILOSOPHY is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from February 20th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.15''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.15).
