== Song Production Information ==
=== [[Jun Wakita|wac]] ===
Nekomata already created a [[Saturated World|NOSTALGIA song]] previously, so this was his second new NOSTALGIA song.

I think he created a new song that completely "grasps" the concept that "NOSTALGIA is a game like this", which he thought after playing it.

During a live performance at JAEPO the other day, we played it in NOSTALGIA and on the piano, and whether you play it on a piano or in a game, it's a cool and fun song which represents NOSTALGIA.

