== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Grand Chariot is part of the [[NEW Generation natsu no ryuusei festa 2016]] (NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016) event, a collaboration event involving beatmania IIDX 23 copula, jubeat Qubell, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS.
** In beatmania IIDX 23 copula, it can be unlocked by completing the ARTCORE course.
*** As of [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], it is available by default.
** In jubeat Qubell, it can be unlocked as the ''NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016'' STAGE 1 unlock of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system. For more information on the dates it can be unlocked, please see [[AC jb Qubell/QUBE Availability|this page]].
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, it can be unlocked by collecting 7 stamps. One stamp is awarded each play session. Its GRAVITY chart could be unlocked via [[BLASTER GATE|INFINITE BLASTER]].
*** From December 15th, 2016, it could be purchased at the SDVX Station.
*** As of [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]], its NOVICE to EXHAUST charts are unlocked by default, while its GRAVITY chart can be unlocked via ''BLASTER GATE''.
* Grand Chariot marks the debut of Yusuke Ishiwata in the beatmania IIDX, DanceDanceRevolution, jubeat, pop'n music, and REFLEC BEAT series.
* Grand Chariot can be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution A, MÚSECA 1+1/2, pop'n music éclale, and REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2 as of October 6th, 2016, as part of the ''NEW Generation ryuusei kakusan festa 2016'' (NEW Generation 流星拡散フェスタ2016) event. To unlock them in ''any'' other BEMANI series, you must have played one of the NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016 songs in beatmania IIDX 23 copula/24 SINOBUZ, jubeat Qubell, or SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS at least once.
** In DanceDanceRevolution A, it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' one chart at a time, starting from BEGINNER/BASIC and all the way up to EXPERT.
*** Like all the other NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016 songs, Grand Chariot could not be unlocked in the North American release of DanceDanceRevolution A until December 1st, 2016.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In MÚSECA 1+1/2, it could be unlocked from October 6th to November 3rd, 2016 as part of the ''NEW Generation ryuusei kakusan festa 2016-ten'' (ニュージェネ流星拡散フェスタ2016展), after three play sessions upon unlocking [[StrayedCatz]]. It is the third song unlock in the event.
*** It was available by default from October 2nd to 31st, 2017 as well.
*** Its Green chart is available by default from June 26th, 2018 for MÚSECA 1+1/2 machines with an offline kit (its Orange and Red charts have to be unlocked with COLORIS, though).
** In pop'n music éclale, it could be unlocked via ''Star Factory'' for 1000 lumina.
*** As of September 28th, 2017 in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked after completing four rounds of gameplay (three play sessions) after unlocking [[ZEPHYRANTHES]]. It is the fourth song unlock in the event.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Grand Chariot displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Grand Chariot was revived on February 8th, 2018.
* Grand Chariot did not appear on ''any'' BEMANI game's OST until the release of the [[pop'n music Usagi to neko to shounen no yume Original Soundtrack|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 Original Soundtrack]] album, two years after the event.
* Grand Chariot was added to [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] on October 6th, 2021 as part of the October 2021 Basic Subscription Monthly Songs.
** From October 5th, 2022, its charts can be purchased with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
** As of March 13th, 2024, it is playable by default.
* Grand Chariot is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from January 18th, 2022, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX 10th Anniversary Music Pack''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 10周年記念 楽曲パック).
* Grand Chariot's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Grand Chariot is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from November 28th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.11''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.11).
* Grand Chariot is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.5''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.5).

