== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* A live version of High School Love featuring vocals by [[Kanako Watanabe|Kanako Hoshino]] appears in the ''beatnation summit -beatmania IIDX premium live-'' DVD.
* A bossa arrangement of High School Love by [[Hiroyuki Togo|Studio Bongo Mango]] featuring vocals by [[Tomoko Okada|Tomoko Kataoka]], titled ''L'amour dans le lycee (High School Love)'', appears in the [[V-RARE SOUND TRACK 16]] CD and the [[pop'n music Cafe music selection]] albums.
** A game size cut of L'amour dans le lycee (High School Love), titled [[L'amour dans le lycee (High School Love -Bossa Arr.-)]], appears in [[AC RB limelight|REFLEC BEAT limelight]].
* High School Love appears as part of the ''PM SUPER BEST すぺしゃるメドレー'', a medley by [[Tsugumi Kataoka]] that appears in the [[pop'n music SUPER BEST BOX]] compilation album.
* An instrumental version of High School Love can be found on the SOUND VOLTEX FLOOR website as an "audition" song for the ''Anata mo★pop'n vocalist!'' (アナタも★ポップンボーカリスト!) contest.

== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* High School Love's jacket uses the character portrait of SYO from [[Love so sweet]], instead of the original art portrait.
* High School Love is playable in beatmania IIDX 14 GOLD via IIDX RECORDS by spending GP. Please see this [https://bemaniwiki.com/?beatmaniaIIDX14+GOLD/%B1%A3%A4%B7%CD%D7%C1%C7#je03df06 page for a full list of requirements by date].
** As of June 27th, 2007 (beat Free), it is playable by default without GP.
* In DanceDanceRevolution Winx Club, High School Love uses the ''Foot Missile'' gimmick.
* In [[CS pnm Utacchi|うたっち]], High School Love's title is capitalized as '''HIGH SCHOOL LOVE'''.
* In うたっち, HIGH SCHOOL LOVE can be bought in the Shop for 5000 points.
* High School Love received an EASY chart on December 12th, 2012 in [[AC pnm Sunny Park|pop'n music Sunny Park]], replacing its old 5-Buttons chart. 
* High School Love was added to jubeat saucer fulfill on November 6th, 2014 as part of the ''Smith no omoide ~ The Lost Memories ~'' (スミスの想いで ～ The Lost Memories ～) event.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from August 31st, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
* High School Love is one of DanceDanceRevolution A's ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' 恋せよDDRのバレンタイン&ホワイトデー2018 songs. It can be unlocked from February 1st, 2018.
** It is the first crossover from DanceDanceRevolution Winx Club to be crossed over to an arcade title.
** It also received new charts in DanceDanceRevolution A.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* High School Love is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] from May 2nd, 2018, after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], High School Love was revived on January 9th, 2020.
* High School Love was incorrectly labeled as a [[AC DistorteD|beatmania IIDX 13 DistorteD]] song when the song became available for free in [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]] on October 14th, 2021, as seen [https://twitter.com/IIDX_OFFICIAL/status/1448560221190692868/photo/1 here].
* High School Love's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat clan ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* High School Love is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from February 20th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.15''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.15).
* High School Love appears as selectable background music in ''CHASE CHASE JOKERS'' (チェイスチェイスジョーカーズ).

