== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Life is beautiful is one of the songs part of the [[BEMANI SUMMER GREETINGS]] event. It could be unlocked in GITADORA Matixx from August 15th, 2018 to September 9th, 2018.
** In [[AC GD EXCHAIN|GITADORA EXCHAIN]] and [[AC GD NEX+AGE|NEX+AGE]], it could be unlocked in [[DX Challenge|Deluxe Mode]] as part of the ''Deluxe kaikin challenge campaign'' (Deluxe解禁チャレンジキャンペーン).
*** In [[AC GD HIGH-VOLTAGE|GITADORA HIGH-VOLTAGE]], it could be unlocked from Deluxe Mode at any time.
*** As of [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is available by default.
** It can be unlocked in jubeat clan from August 16th, 2018.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART'' (note that unlike other songs, it cannot be obtained through Music Conduction).
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** It can be unlocked in pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 from August 23rd, 2018 as the third unlock of the first ''SUMMER STAGE'' of ''NAVIfes'' (ナビフェス) unlocking system.
*** In the Korean version of pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢, it is available from September 3rd, 2018 instead.
*** As of December 3rd, 2018 in [[AC pnm peace|pop'n music peace]], it is available by default.
** It could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN from August 23rd to September 30th, 2018.
*** From [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]] onwards, it can be purchased with PCB from June 27th, 2019.
** It can be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution A from August 30th, 2018 via ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' one chart at a time, starting from BEGINNER/BASIC and all the way up to EXPERT.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* Life is beautiful is not playable in the Korean version of GITADORA Matixx, due to GRAC.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Life is beautiful displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* Life is beautiful was credited to '''吸川 ヒカル''' in the data of earlier builds of GITADORA Matixx and jubeat clan, before the BEMANI SUMMER GREETINGS event started.
** Its jacket also credited the song to '''Hikaru Suikawa''', while in the final release, it does not have an artist credited at all.
* Life is beautiful is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.2's ''Mid-Summer Island'' event. It could be unlocked from October 25th to November 14th, 2018 by collecting 90 stamps.
** It could be unlocked again from January 31st to February 20th, 2019.
** It could be unlocked again from August 8th to 21st, 2019.
** In [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]], it can be unlocked from June 11th, 2020 from the [[AC NST Op.3/Old Hidden Songs|ノスタルジアFORTE&Op.2 イベント]] section at the Episode selection screen.
* Unused data for Life is beautiful can be found in the [[AC NST FORTE|ノスタルジア FORTE]] game data.
* Life is beautiful's EX chart was re-rated in pop'n music peace on March 5th, 2019.
* Life is beautiful was added to [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s REGULAR course on August 1st, 2019.
** It is also available in GRAVITY WARS コナステ's INFINITE course and [[CS SDVX EG|EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from October 2nd, 2019, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.4''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.4).
* Life is beautiful also appears in jubeat (2021)'s plus mode, as part of '''clan pack 8'''.
* Life is beautiful is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] as part of '''Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK''' (特別企画セレクションパック).
* Life is beautiful is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 13th, 2024, by purchasing '''BEMANI SELECTION music pack vol.1''' (BEMANI SELECTION楽曲パック vol.1).
* Life is beautiful is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).

