== Trivia ==
* Sakura Reflection is Ryutaro Nakahara's first original contribution to the REFLEC BEAT series.
* According to Ryutaro Nakahara, REFLEC BEAT director [[Yoshitaka Nishimura]] asked him to make Sakura Reflection to make his Sakura series a trilogy.
** However, Ryutaro would later release a fourth "Sakura" song, Sakura Luminance.
* In REFLEC BEAT, Sakura Reflection was a FINAL ROUND-exclusive song.
** In [[AC RB limelight|REFLEC BEAT limelight]], it is the final unlock in the final part of Glass Stage 1-1. It is the 9th old REFLEC BEAT song in limelight unlocked via Glass Stage.
** In [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]], it is unlocked by reaching Stage 3 of Pastel Adventure (パステルアドベンチャー) in Reflecting Mountain (初代リフレク山).
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was available by default.
* Unlocking Sakura Reflection in REFLEC BEAT or limelight also unlocks the song in beatmania IIDX 18 Resort Anthem or [[AC Lincle|beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle]], as part of [[Lincle LINK]] 1.
** As of June 27th, 2012, it can be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle by reaching Q-pro Level 10 (as part of Lincle LINK 5). It is the third Lincle LINK 1 song in Lincle to be unlocked this way.
*** As of May 14th, 2014, Sakura Reflection is instantly unlocked in [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]] if an eAMUSEMENT PASS is used.
* Sakura Reflection is one of the songs featured on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5-IrAGbjKcA BEMANI SONGS ～Best of REFLEC BEAT～] video.
* Sakura Reflection was added to BeatStream アニムトライヴ on March 17th, 2016, as part of the ''BeaSt selection! Haru no Nyan matsuri!'' (ビーストせれくしょん! 春のにゃん祭り!) event.
* Sakura Reflection can be unlocked from August 9th, 2016, in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]]' ''Akashic Explore'' event.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Sakura Reflection was revived on January 19th, 2017.
* Sakura Reflection is one of DanceDanceRevolution A's ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' 新緑薫るパワフルMUSIC songs. It can be unlocked from April 26th, 2018.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* Sakura Reflection's difficulty level change from DanceDanceRevolution A20 was applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.
* Sakura Reflection is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from May 25th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.19''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.19).
* Sakura Reflection was added to ポラリスコード on October 22nd, 2026.

