* Sephirot is part of the [[NEW Generation natsu no ryuusei festa 2016]] (NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016) event, a collaboration event involving beatmania IIDX 23 copula, jubeat Qubell, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS.
** In beatmania IIDX 23 copula, it can be unlocked by completing the SUMMER course.
*** As of [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], it is available by default.
