*** As of September 28th, 2017 in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked after completing one round of gameplay (three play sessions). It is the first song unlock in the event.
