== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* ZEPHYRANTHES is part of the [[NEW Generation natsu no ryuusei festa 2016]] (NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016) event, a collaboration event involving beatmania IIDX 23 copula, jubeat Qubell, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS.
** In beatmania IIDX 23 copula, it can be unlocked by completing the TAG course.
*** As of [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], it is available by default.
** In jubeat Qubell, it can be unlocked as the ''NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016'' STAGE 4 unlock of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system. For more information on the dates it can be unlocked, please see [[AC jb Qubell/QUBE Availability|this page]].
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS, it can be unlocked by collecting 2 stamps. One stamp is awarded each play session. Its GRAVITY chart could be unlocked via [[BLASTER GATE|INFINITE BLASTER]].
*** From December 15th, 2016, it could be purchased at the SDVX Station.
*** As of [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]], its NOVICE to EXHAUST charts are unlocked by default, while its GRAVITY chart can be unlocked via ''BLASTER GATE''.
* ''Zephyranthes'' are a genus of temperate and tropical plants in the Amaryllis family, native to the Western Hemisphere and widely cultivated as ornaments. Common names include fairy lily, rainflower, zephyr lily, magic lily, Atamasco lily, and rain lily.
* ZEPHYRANTHES marks TAG's first non-collaboration original song in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
** It also marks his first appearance in the MÚSECA series.
* ZEPHYRANTHES can be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution A, MÚSECA 1+1/2, pop'n music éclale, and REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2 as of October 6th, 2016, as part of the ''NEW Generation ryuusei kakusan festa 2016'' (NEW Generation 流星拡散フェスタ2016) event. To unlock them in ''any'' other BEMANI series, you must have played one of the NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016 songs in beatmania IIDX 23 copula/24 SINOBUZ, jubeat Qubell, or SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS at least once.
** In DanceDanceRevolution A, it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR'' one chart at a time, starting from BEGINNER/BASIC and all the way up to EXPERT.
*** Like all the other NEW Generation 夏の流星フェスタ2016 songs, ZEPHYRANTHES could not be unlocked in the North American release of DanceDanceRevolution A until December 1st, 2016.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In MÚSECA 1+1/2, it could be unlocked from October 6th to November 3rd, 2016 as part of the ''NEW Generation ryuusei kakusan festa 2016-ten'' (ニュージェネ流星拡散フェスタ2016展), after three play sessions upon unlocking [[Grand Chariot]]. It is the fourth song unlock in the event.
*** It was available by default from October 2nd to 31st, 2017 as well.
*** Its Green chart is available by default from June 26th, 2018 for MÚSECA 1+1/2 machines with an offline kit (its Orange and Red charts have to be unlocked with COLORIS, though).
** In pop'n music éclale, it could be unlocked via ''Star Factory'' for 1000 lumina.
*** As of September 28th, 2017 in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked after completing two rounds of gameplay (three play sessions) after unlocking [[Sephirot]]. It is the second song unlock in the event.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, ZEPHYRANTHES displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], ZEPHYRANTHES was revived on March 23rd, 2017.
* ZEPHYRANTHES did not appear on ''any'' BEMANI game's OST until the release of the [[pop'n music Usagi to neko to shounen no yume Original Soundtrack|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 Original Soundtrack]] album, two years after the event.
* ZEPHYRANTHES's difficulty changes from DanceDanceRevolution A20 were applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.
* ZEPHYRANTHES could be unlocked in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s INFINITE course from March 4th, 2020 through March 31st, 2020 by playing INFINITE at least once during that time frame.
** In [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]], it could be unlocked via [[CS SDVX EG/BLASTER GATE|BLASTER GATE]] from March 2nd, 2022 through March 31st, 2022.
* ZEPHYRANTHES is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.11''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.11).
* ZEPHYRANTHES received LEGGENDARIA charts in [[AC HEROIC VERSE|beatmania IIDX 27 HEROIC VERSE]]. These charts can be unlocked via ARENA MODE from June 18th, 2020 by collecting 100 ARENA CUBES.
** From February 25th, 2021, these charts can be purchased in [[AC BISTROVER|beatmania IIDX 28 BISTROVER]] with [[AC BISTROVER/Bistraurant Guide|Bistraurant Guide]] (ビストランガイド).
** These charts are available in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] since July 26th, 2023.
* ZEPHYRANTHES's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* ZEPHYRANTHES is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from November 28th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.11''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.11).
* ZEPHYRANTHES is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.5''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.5).

