== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～ was the winner song of the ''Support the chikuwa princess'' part of the [[Hinatabi chikuwa-hime ketteisen]] (日向美ちくわ姫決定戦) event. It was added to BeatStream アニムトライヴ, DanceDanceRevolution A, GITADORA Tri-Boost, jubeat Qubell, MÚSECA, pop'n music éclale, REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, and SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS on April 18th, 2016.
