* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～'s music video eliminates any on-screen dancers in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
* In pop'n music, despite that [[AC pnm Sunny Park|pop'n music Sunny Park]]'s [[Kokuu to koumyou no discourse|霜月凛]] is used in 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～, 霜月凛 received a new portrait.
