* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛edition～'s SPECIAL chart is purchasable in REFLEC BEAT plus from April 3rd, 2017.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～ was revived on September 21st, 2017.
* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～'s EX chart was re-rated in [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]] on December 19th, 2017.
* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～'s difficulty changes from [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]] were applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.
* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～ is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HinaBitter♪ SELECTION PACK''' (コナステ GITADORA ひなビタ♪セレクションパック).
* 黒髪乱れし修羅となりて～凛 edition～'s [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
