== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* A different cut of セツナトリップ is used in REFLEC BEAT plus.
* A piano arrangement of セツナトリップ by marasy is used in the ノスタルジア series.
* A cover of セツナトリップ, performed by [[Mayumi Morinaga]], appears on her compilation album, [[All that is. Is that all?]].

== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* セツナトリップ is Last Note.'s sixth single. It was later included on Last Note.'s first album, ''セツナコード''.
* セツナトリップ was added to SOUND VOLTEX BOOTH on August 24th, 2012.
* セツナトリップ's SOUND VOLTEX EXHAUST chart is known for introducing a new analog chain trap in the chorus, colloquially and aptly named the "セツナトラップ" (Setsuna trap).
* セツナトリップ was one of the qualifying round songs in the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2012]] for SOUND VOLTEX BOOTH.
* セツナトリップ was added to REFLEC BEAT colette -Summer- on September 3rd, 2013 as a default song.
* セツナトリップ received a different song cut and jacket in REFLEC BEAT plus.
** While ポップンリズミン and jubeat plus don't use this new song cut, they use the REFLEC BEAT plus jacket, though.
* セツナトリップ (REFLEC BEAT plus version) and [[NEON WORLD]] are the only songs in the REFLEC BEAT series to have a BASIC chart rated Level 2 and a HARD chart rated Level 10 (on the 1-13 scale).
* In REFLEC BEAT plus, ポップンリズミン,jubeat plus and ポラリスコード, セツナトリップ's artist is just credited to '''Last Note.'''.
* セツナトリップ was added to pop'n music Sunny Park on September 19th, 2013.
* GUMI is not selectable as a player character in pop'n music.
** While GUMI used her GREAT animation for her FEVER animation (which can be seen by playing a song with GUMI as the rival character and clearing a Highlight Zone), a different, unused FEVER animation could be found on the data (although it could be seen by hacking GUMI as a player character as her regular FEVER animation). Since [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], this latter FEVER animation is used by GUMI even as a rival character.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, セツナトリップ displays its jacket on the song selection screen.
* セツナトリップ is the only licensed song part of ポップンリズミン's default song list.
* セツナトリップ is one of the LIVE unlocks in GITADORA. It was added on October 28th, 2013. 
** In [[AC GD OverDrive|GITADORA OverDrive]], it is available by default for new players with an [[e-amusement|eAMUSEMENT]] PASS.
** As of the end of March 2014 in GITADORA OverDrive, it is available by default for all players.
* セツナトリップ is the Challenge C of jubeat saucer's ''Smith Seminar'' (スミスゼミナール) event.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from September 24th, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it is part of the ''Step'' unlocking system, unlockable by reaching Step Level 3.
** As of [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is available by default.
* Despite being a licensed song, セツナトリップ was not included on the TV・J-ポップ category until [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]].
** セツナトリップ was added back to the pop'n music Sunny Park category in [[AC pnm UniLab|pop'n music UniLab]].
* セツナトリップ was added to DanceDanceRevolution (2014) on June 19th, 2014, as part of the [[GUMI 5th Anniversary party Presented by BEMANI]] event.
* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], セツナトリップ's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
* As of August 19th, 2014, セツナトリップ's EXTREME chart has been changed in jubeat saucer fulfill to match its new audio.
* セツナトリップ received a NIGHTMARE chart in BeatStream on February 19th, 2015, unlockable via ''BEAST HACKER''.
* HIGH TENSION was added to セツナトリップ's charts in [[AC BST AnimTribe|BeatStream アニムトライヴ]].
* セツナトリップ currently holds the record as the licensed song to have appeared in the most number of BEMANI games, having appeared in BeatStream, DanceDanceRevolution, GuitarFreaks & DrumMania, jubeat, MÚSECA, pop'n music, REFLEC BEAT, SOUND VOLTEX, and ''ミライダガッキ FutureTomTom''.
* セツナトリップ received new BASIC and ADVANCED charts for Guitar and Drum in [[AC GD Tri-Boost|GITADORA Tri-Boost]] on July 29th, 2016.
* セツナトリップ received a new set of charts in [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]].
* セツナトリップ received a HEAVENLY chart in [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]] as part of the [[BLASTER GATE]] unlock system. It can be unlocked since the game's release date.
** This chart is also available in [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]] from September 5th, 2019.
* セツナトリップ's EASY chart was re-rated in pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢 on March 29th, 2017.
* セツナトリップ was added to ノスタルジア FORTE on November 16th, 2017.
* セツナトリップ received UPPER charts in [[AC pnm Kaimei Riddles|pop'n music 解明リドルズ]].
* Upon its debut, セツナトリップ(UPPER) did not use its original chart's background. This was fixed on October 18th, 2022 in [[AC pnm UniLab|pop'n music UniLab]].
* The piano version of セツナトリップ was added to jubeat (2021) on June 3rd, 2021.
** It also received an EXTREME chart on June 15th, 2021.
* セツナトリップ was added to [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] on October 12th, 2022.
* セツナトリップ received new charts, including brand-new MASTER charts, in [[AC GD GALAXY WAVE|GITADORA GALAXY WAVE]].
* セツナトリップ was added to ポラリスコード on September 11th, 2024.
* セツナトリップ has also appeared in ''PUMP IT UP PRIME Japanese Edition''.
* セツナトリップ received CHALLENGE charts in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] on August 7th, 2025.
* セツナトリップ's UPPER charts are absent from the North American release of [[AC pnm High Cheers!!|pop'n music High☆Cheers!!]]. However, its original charts are present in the game.
* セツナトリップ's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

