== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Cleopatrysm is one of the Statue's Awakening (彫像の覚醒) unlockable songs of the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event.
** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC GD Tri-Boost Re:EVOLVE|GITADORA Tri-Boost Re:EVOLVE]], it could be unlocked as part of the ''Shinshun! GITADORA OMIKUJI'' (新春! ギタドラOMIKUJI) event from January 11th to 31st, 2017.
*** From [[AC GD Matixx|GITADORA Matixx]] to [[AC GD HIGH-VOLTAGE|HIGH-VOLTAGE]], it could be unlocked by clearing it in [[DX Challenge|Deluxe Mode]].
*** As of [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from August 31st, 2015.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Emerald STAGE 12 unlocks of jubeat Qubell's ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From September 19th, 2015, it could be unlocked in pop'n music ラピストリア via Story Mode.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 250 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Cleopatrysm displays its jacket (with the 発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡 logo) on the song selection screen.
* When playing the song in SOUND VOLTEX, Cleopatrysm's related Statue from the song's jacket appears in the background. 
* Cleopatrysm's title is a reference to [[Wikipedia:Cleopatra|Cleopatra]], the last active pharaoh in Ancient Egypt.
** According to Shoccho, Cleopatrysm's working title was '''クレオパトラ（仮）''' ("Cleopatra (kari)").
* Pyrami°C (ピラミッ℃) is read as "pyramid". The "°C" being read as "do" is a reference to [http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7nONbREeNJs Sota's line in APPEND TRAVELのうた], which was used to promote the [[APPEND TRAVEL]] event in 2012.
* Cleopatrysm marks Masaya Oya's debut in the DanceDanceRevolution, jubeat, GuitarFreaks & DrumMania, and ミライダガッキ FutureTomTom series.
* Cleopatrysm's jubeat charts were created by RAMIEL [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=9].
* Cleopatrysm could be unlocked in MÚSECA 1+1/2 from December 8th, 2016 to January 9th, 2017 as part of the ''Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki-ten'' (発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡展) event.
** It was available by default from September 1st to October 1st, 2017 as well.
** Its Green chart is available by default from June 26th, 2018 for MÚSECA 1+1/2 machines with an offline kit (its Orange and Red charts have to be unlocked with COLORIS, though).
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Cleopatrysm was revived on February 2nd, 2017. 
* Cleopatrysm was added to [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] on April 8th, 2020 as part of the April 2020 Basic Subscription Monthly Songs.
** From October 6th, 2021 in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]], it could be purchased with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
** From April 20th, 2022, it is available by default.
* Cleopatrysm is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HISTORY PACK vol.7''' (コナステ GITADORA HISTORYパック vol.7).
* Cleopatrysm's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Cleopatrysm is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 20th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.17''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.17).
* Cleopatrysm is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).

