== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* In The Breeze is the prologue song to the [[BEMANI SUMMER DIARY 2015]] event.
* In The Breeze was added to all games participating in BEMANI SUMMER DIARY 2015 on July 16th, 2015. It can be unlocked by playing any game once.
** In [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]], it could be purchased with [[AC copula/PULACO ticket unlocks|PULACO tickets]] from February 3rd, 2016.
*** As of [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], it is available by default.
** From December 3rd, 2015, its LIGHT chart has been automatically unlocked in BeatStream, while its MEDIUM and BEAST charts can be unlocked via the Takahashi-san mail ''BisCo no enikki'' in ''Takahashi-san Lab.''.
*** In [[AC BST AnimTribe|BeatStream アニムトライヴ]], In The Breeze is playable by default.
** From November 5th, 2015, it could be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution (2014) via ''EXTRA ATTACK''.
*** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC GD Tri-Boost Re:EVOLVE|GITADORA Tri-Boost Re:EVOLVE]], it could be unlocked as part of the ''Shinshun! GITADORA OMIKUJI'' (新春! ギタドラOMIKUJI) event from January 18th to February 7th, 2017.
*** From [[AC GD Matixx|GITADORA Matixx]] to [[AC GD HIGH-VOLTAGE|HIGH-VOLTAGE]], it could be unlocked by clearing it in [[DX Challenge|Deluxe Mode]].
*** As of [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
*** From [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 250 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased in the Garage from November 16th, 2015 after obtaining 20 VOLZZA KEYs.
*** In [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was playable by default.
* In The Breeze marks the first song by either Daisuke Kurosawa or Sota Fujimori with Mayumi Morinaga as a vocalist.
* According to 96, In The Breeze was completed just in time for the BEMANI SUMMER DIARY 2015 event.
* In The Breeze's lyrics are written in its jacket.
* The location photographed in In the Breeze's jacket is speculated to be the Kobe Sky Bridge.
* In the SOUND VOLTEX series, a cloudy blue sky and field of sunflowers appear in the gameplay background for In The Breeze.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, In The Breeze displays its jacket (with the BEMANI SUMMER DIARY 2015 logo) when selected.
* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], In The Breeze's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.
** In The Breeze lost its video in DanceDanceRevolution A, which caused the song to be played on the BOOM BOOM BOOM stage instead. The video was restored on April 6th, 2016.
* In The Breeze ranked #1 in the BEMANI Fan Site CHECK!SONGS Monthly Ranking list for July 2015.
* In The Breeze placed first in the staff chosen ''BEMANI MUSIC AWARDS 2015'', which can be watched on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzysdqgIGLY 113th BEMANI Namahousou (kari)] (BEMANI生放送（仮）).
* In The Breeze is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.9''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.9).
* In The Breeze's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* In The Breeze is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.7''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.7).
* In The Breeze is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK vol.2''' (コナステ GITADORA 特別企画セレクションパック vol.2).
* In The Breeze is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from December 21st, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.24''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.24).
* In the DanceDanceRevolution series prior to DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, In The Breeze's BPM is listed as 123-142 for all of its difficulties.
* In The Breeze received CHALLENGE charts in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, unlockable from August 21st, 2025 through ''EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD''.
** These charts are available by default in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX from August 21st, 2025.

