== Trivia ==
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! marks Yoshitaka Nishimura's first use of his Lucky Vacuum alias in the REFLEC BEAT series.
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is a FINAL ROUND exclusive song in REFLEC BEAT. To play it, unlock [[Sacred Oath]] '''and''' reach Level 80. You can also unlock it by reaching Level 150 and unlocking it at 425,000 EXP (as of July 14th, 2011).
** In [[AC RB limelight|REFLEC BEAT limelight]], SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is unlocked by reaching the first part of Glass Stage 1-3. It is the 20th old REFLEC BEAT song in limelight unlocked via Glass Stage.
** In [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]], it is unlocked by reaching Stage 7 of Pastel Adventure (パステルアドベンチャー) in Reflecting Mountain (初代リフレク山).
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], it was available by default.
* Unlocking SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! in REFLEC BEAT or limelight also unlocks the song in beatmania IIDX 18 Resort Anthem or [[AC Lincle|beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle]], as part of [[Lincle LINK]] 1.
** As of June 27th, 2012, however, as part of Lincle LINK 5, it can be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle by reaching Q-pro Level 25. It is the fifth Lincle LINK 1 song in Lincle to be unlocked.
** As of May 14th, 2014, SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is instantly unlocked in [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]] if an eAMUSEMENT PASS is used.
* In all of SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN!'s REFLEC BEAT charts, Objects are placed in the silence ''before'' the song begins.
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! received a SPECIAL chart in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. It could be unlocked from August 14th, 2014 to August 27th, 2014 in the ''PASTEL WONDER QUEST'' (パステルワンダークエスト) event of REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. To unlock it, you must win ten times on Normal difficulty in the Wonder Coliseum (ワンダーコロシアム).
** From August 28th, 2014, it could be purchased from the REFLEC Shop for 5000 Refle.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]], it could be purchased from the Garage for 8 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked by clearing its HARD chart a specific number of times, depending on the grade obtained on it (AAA+: 1 time, AAA: 2 times, AA: 3 times, A or lower: 5 times).
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is one of the unlockable songs of DanceDanceRevolution (2014)'s ''EXTRA ATTACK'' unlocking system. It was added on August 28th, 2014.
** From December 17th, 2015 onwards, SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! has been automatically unlocked for all players.
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] from May 2nd, 2017, after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! was revived on June 8th, 2017.
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from March 30th to May 8th, 2022, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 6 stamps.
** Since January 30th, 2024, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from May 25th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.21''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.21).
* SPECIAL SUMMER CAMPAIGN! is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from October 11th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).

