* ビビットストリーム is one of the unlocks of the [[Kaitou BisCo no yokokujou!!]] (怪盗BisCoの予告状!!) event. It could be unlocked from June 17th to December 21st, 2015.
** In DanceDanceRevolution (2014), it is one of the panel unlocks of the DanceDanceRevolution (2014) Museum.
*** From January 7th, 2016, ビビットストリーム can be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution (2014) via ''EXTRA ATTACK''.
*** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], ビビットストリーム can be unlocked via ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In jubeat prop, it is one of the panel unlocks of the jubeat prop Museum.
*** ビビットストリーム can appear randomly as WEEKLY BONUS MUSIC since February 11th, 2016.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it was one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** From February 23rd, 2017 in jubeat Qubell to [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it was available by default for [[e-amusement|e-AMUSEMENT]] PASS users.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
*** From [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]] onwards, it is once again available by default with an e-amusement pass.
* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], ビビットストリーム's music video eliminates any on-screen dancers.
* ビビットストリーム received a NIGHTMARE chart in BeatStream on November 26th, 2015, unlockable via ''BEAST HACKER''.
* ビビットストリーム is one of the songs featured on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V-97ucPnRT4 BEMANI SONGS　～Best of BeatStream～] video.
