* ビビットストリーム could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN from April 13th to May 13th, 2018 as part of the ''Maybe~nyuugaku!? BeatStream gakkyoku VOLTE ni chakkou daisakusen!!'' (メイビ～入学!? BeatStream楽曲ボルテに着港大作戦!!) event. It could be unlocked after obtaining two stamps.
