*** From [[AC GD Matixx|GITADORA Matixx]] to [[AC GD HIGH-VOLTAGE|HIGH-VOLTAGE]], it could be unlocked by clearing it in [[DX Challenge|Deluxe Mode]].
*** As of [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from August 31st, 2015.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From September 19th, 2015, it could be unlocked in pop'n music ラピストリア via Story Mode.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 250 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, 御千手メディテーション displays its jacket (with the 発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡 logo) on the song selection screen.
* When playing 御千手メディテーション in SOUND VOLTEX, [[Cleopatrysm]]'s related Statue from the song's jacket appears in the background.
* 御千手メディテーション marks Shohei Uno's debut in the DanceDanceRevolution, GuitarFreaks & DrumMania, jubeat, pop'n music and ミライダガッキ FutureTomTom series.
* 御千手メディテーション's jubeat charts were created by MICHI [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=9].
* 御千手メディテーション's HYPER chart was re-rated in pop'n music éclale on March 22nd, 2016.
* 御千手メディテーション could be unlocked in MÚSECA 1+1/2 from December 8th, 2016 to January 9th, 2017 as part of the ''Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki-ten'' (発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡展) event.
** It was available by default from September 1st to October 1st, 2017 as well.
** Its Green chart is available by default from June 26th, 2018 for MÚSECA 1+1/2 machines with an offline kit (its Orange and Red charts have to be unlocked with COLORIS, though).
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], 御千手メディテーション was revived on November 2nd, 2017.
* 御千手メディテーション is believed to be representing the Hindu goddess Durga, as a being with multiple arms in meditation is in the central focus of the jacket, and echidna is the pop'n music character for the song, who borrows a Hindi aesthetic in combination with the Greek portrayal of the monster of the same name.
* 御千手メディテーション is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.7''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.7).
* 御千手メディテーション is available in GAME PLAY mode for free players in [[CS ULTIMATE MOBILE|beatmania IIDX ULTIMATE MOBILE]] as of July 6th, 2023.
* 御千手メディテーション is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HISTORY PACK vol.7''' (コナステ GITADORA HISTORYパック vol.7).
* 御千手メディテーション's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* 御千手メディテーション is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 20th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.17''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.17).
* 御千手メディテーション is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).

