* 灼熱Beach Side Bunny is part of DJ Mass MAD Izm*'s Shakunetsu (灼熱) song series.
* An extended version of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny appears in DJ Mass MAD Izm*'s first album, [[I AM NOT A DJ]]. This version contains a different ending from the game version, with the sample of "Yo!" in a different pitch.
* 灼熱Beach Side Bunny is sampled in [[X-DEN]], from [[AC Rootage|beatmania IIDX 26 Rootage]].
* A remix of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny by [[Shunsuke Sato|SYUNN]], titled [[Shakunetsu Beach Side Bunny (STARDOM Remix)|灼熱Beach Side Bunny (STARDOM Remix)]], appears in [[AC DRS|DANCERUSH STARDOM]].
* Another remix of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny by [[Masayoshi Iimori]], titled [[Shakunetsu Beach Side Bunny (Masayoshi Iimori Remix)|灼熱Beach Side Bunny (Masayoshi Iimori Remix)]], appears in the [[beatmania IIDX 20th Anniversary Tribute BEST]] album.
** A short version of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny (Masayoshi Iimori Remix) appears in [[AC HEROIC VERSE|beatmania IIDX 27 HEROIC VERSE]].
* Another remix of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny by [[Masaya Oya|かめりあ]], titled [[Shakunetsu Beach Side Bunny (Camellia's "Summertime D'n'B" Remix)|灼熱Beach Side Bunny (かめりあ's "Summertime D'n'B" Remix)]], can be found in the limited edition exclusive CD included with Camellia's fourth major album, [[Hai no habataki|灰の羽搏]].
** A short version of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny (かめりあ's "Summertime D'n'B" Remix) appears in [[AC EPOLIS|beatmania IIDX 31 EPOLIS]].
* The "YO!" sample used near the beginning of 灼熱Beach Side Bunny originates from the song [https://youtu.be/mL2Bgj-za5k?t=33 ''Incredible'' by M-Beat featuring General Levy] (0:33).

