== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was released as a digital single on November 18th, 2015 and was later included on the Five Drops 04 -pure grape- 春日咲子 and [[Home Sweet Home]] albums.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was added to BeatStream, DanceDanceRevolution (2014), GITADORA Tri-Boost, jubeat prop, and REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA on October 29th, 2015.
** In BeatStream, its MEDIUM and BEAST charts could be unlocked via the Mei mail ''Shin hakkenda wa'' in ''Takahashi-san Lab.''.
*** As of December 3rd, 2015, these charts have been unlocked by default.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー's unique video was added to DanceDanceRevolution (2014) on November 24th, 2015. It eliminates any on-screen dancers prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]].
** It was later added to GITADORA Tri-Boost on February 24th, 2016.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was added to MÚSECA on December 24th, 2015.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was added to SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS on January 7th, 2016.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー marks pizuya's debut in the BeatStream, DanceDanceRevolution, jubeat, pop'n music, REFLEC BEAT and SOUND VOLTEX series.
** It is also his first song in BEMANI without [[Youhei Kimura|ARM]].
** It is also Futoumeido's debut in the BeatStream, DanceDanceRevolution, GuitarFreaks & DrumMania, jubeat, REFLEC BEAT and SOUND VOLTEX series.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was revived on September 21st, 2017.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA HinaBitter♪ SELECTION PACK''' (コナステ GITADORA ひなビタ♪セレクションパック).
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from February 14th, 2025, by purchasing '''SPECIAL music pack feat.HinaBitter♪ vol.3''' (スペシャル楽曲パック feat.ひなビタ♪ vol.3).
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー was added to ポラリスコード on November 13th, 2025.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー received CHALLENGE charts in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], unlockable from December 25th, 2025 through EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD, after having unlocked the CHALLENGE charts of [[Chihou sousei chikuwactics|地方創生☆チクワクティクス]].
** These charts are available by default in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX from December 25th, 2025.
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''HinaBitter♪ Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (ひなビタ♪セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* 漆黒のスペシャルプリンセスサンデー's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

