== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* 海神 is one of the unlockable songs of the final phase of REFLEC BEAT colette -Summer-'s ''Pastel Adventure'' colette Fishing unlocking system.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], 海神 was playable by default.
* 海神 marks the first time Yoshihiro Tagawa composes a BEMANI song without using his DJ TOTTO alias.
* 海神 is one of the unlockable crossover songs for beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and pop'n music ラピストリア on the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event.
** From September 19th, 2015, it could be unlocked in pop'n music ラピストリア via Story Mode.
** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 250 lumina.
** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, 海神 displays its jacket (with the 発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡 logo) when selected.
* 海神 could be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution (2014) from January 22nd, 2015 as part of the ''BOSS ON PARADE'' event.
** To access 海神, you had to play any song in DanceDanceRevolution (2014) that has a REFLEC BEAT chart rated Level 10+ (Level 11 or higher in [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]]/VOLZZA 2). Songs that debuted in DanceDanceRevolution and REFLEC BEAT simultaneously don't count. For a complete list of supported songs, please see [[BOSS ON PARADE Medal-supported Songs|this page]].
** From December 24th, 2015 onwards, 海神 has been automatically unlocked for all players.
* 海神 is one of the unlocks of the [[Kaitou BisCo no yokokujou!!]] (怪盗BisCoの予告状!!) event. It could be unlocked in BeatStream from June 17th to December 21st, 2015, after the REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper Museum is completed.
** In [[AC BST AnimTribe|BeatStream アニムトライヴ]], it could be unlocked from April 7th, 2016 via the ''BEAST CRISIS 外伝'' (gaiden) unlocking system.
* 海神's generic movie was changed in BeatStream アニムトライヴ.
* In REFLEC BEAT +, 海神's title and artist are romanized.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], 海神 was revived on January 19th, 2017.
* 海神 was added to [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] on July 8th, 2020 as part of the July 2020 Basic Subscription Monthly Songs.
** From December 8th, 2021 in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]], it can be purchased with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* 海神 was added to jubeat (2021) on March 30th, 2022.
* 海神 can be unlocked in jubeat festo from June 22nd to July 12th, 2022 as part of the Stamp Challenge unlocking system, by obtaining 20 stamps.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it could be unlocked in ''STAR RECORD'' from February 8th to 28th, 2023, by lighting up 15 stars.
* 海神 is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 13th, 2024, by purchasing '''BEMANI SELECTION music pack vol.1''' (BEMANI SELECTION楽曲パック vol.1).
** It received brand-new CHALLENGE charts. By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, 海神's CHALLENGE charts can be played in [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]] and [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]].
** From March 31st, 2025 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, these charts are available by default for all players.
* 海神 received LEGGENDARIA charts in [[AC EPOLIS|beatmania IIDX 31 EPOLIS]]' ARENA MODE. They could be unlocked from September 19th, 2024 through October 6th, 2024 by collecting 100 ARENA CUBES.
** In [[AC Pinky Crush|beatmania IIDX 32 Pinky Crush]], these charts can be purchased with [[AC Pinky Crush/Hizou no record|Hizou no record]] (秘蔵のレコード) from February 6th, 2025.
** As of [[AC Sparkle Shower|beatmania IIDX 33 Sparkle Shower]], they are available by default.

