== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* IX and IX -GITADOROCK ver.- are the only unlockable songs of ''The strongest tournament in history'' (史上最強の大会) of the [[Nettou! BEMANI Stadium]] (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム) event. This tournament was added on February 6th, 2014.
** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from August 26th, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From March 16th, 2015, it could be unlocked in [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]] via Story Mode.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 100 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] and [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]], IX can be purchased from the REFLEC Shop after clearing it in the BEMANI Stadium Test (BEMANIスタジアム検定) added on July 24th, 2014.
*** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], IX is playable by default.
* IX marks the first collaboration between Takayuki Ishikawa and Yoshihiro Tagawa in BEMANI.
** Both Takayuki Ishikawa and Yoshihiro Tagawa appear in IX's jacket.
* IX marks the first appearance of Yoshihiro Tagawa in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* IX is the Roman numeral for 9.
** When IX is played on beatmania IIDX, the arcade LED ticker displays "NINE".
** IX's title might be a reference to the nine players of a baseball team.
** Also, not counting [[Engraved Mark]], IX is the ninth original song of the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム event.
** There are also nine BEMANI games involved in the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム event.
** When the songlist is organized alphabetically, IX is shown amongst the song titles which start with numbers.
*** In DanceDanceRevolution (2013), when sorting songs by "ABC TITLE" (alphabetical order), IX used to be listed in the "I" folder, next to [[INTO YOUR HEART (Ruffage remix)]]. This has since been corrected; IX now correctly appears in the "NUM" folder, next to [[888]].
*** In the pop'n music series, it is sorted as "ナイン".
** IX is the ninth unlockable song in ポップンリズミン's TREASURE MODE.
** IX is the ninth song listed on the ''熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK'' album.
* IX's vocalist Ai (藍) is the leader of the Japanese metal band ''DEATHGAZE''.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, IX displays its jacket (with the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム logo) on the song selection screen.
* IX's pop'n music character MZD was made available from February 4th, 2014 as a player character, ''before'' IX could be unlocked.
* Upon its debut in pop'n music, IX's artist was displayed as '''dj TAKA VS DJ TOTTO''', without the "feat.藍" credit. This was fixed on February 25th, 2014.
** This artist credit also appeared in IX's ポップンリズミン jacket.
* IX is the only song from the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム event to receive song comments in the pop'n music Sunny Park website.
* IX's jubeat charts were created by RAG [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=8].
* In DanceDanceRevolution, IX's EXPERT and CHALLENGE charts have the same notecount for both Single and Double.
* IX's CHALLENGE charts can be played in DanceDanceRevolution (2013) from February 26th, 2014 on the EXTRA STAGE.
** To play IX's CHALLENGE charts, you must have played all the songs from the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム event in DanceDanceRevolution (2013), and then meet the normal EXTRA STAGE requirements. IX's CHALLENGE charts will be available on the EXTRA STAGE.
** Since July 24th, 2014, IX's CHALLENGE charts can be unlocked via ''EXTRA ATTACK'' on [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]]. You must have unlocked IX's lower difficulties in order to be able to unlock its CHALLENGE charts.
* From DanceDanceRevolution (2014) onwards, IX appears in the DanceDanceRevolution (2014) folder instead of the (2013) folder.
* IX was added to ポップンリズミン as a TREASURE MODE unlockable song on July 16th, 2014. Its map can be accessed after purchasing the two BEMANIスタジアム packs available for purchase since July 18th, 2014.
* To unlock IX in jubeat plus or REFLEC BEAT plus, you must have purchased both BEMANIスタジアム packs in their respective games. Then, you can download the song by tapping the Gift button at the Store.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], IX was revived on June 21st, 2018.
* IX is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.6''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.6).
* IX received a VIVID chart in [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]]. It can be unlocked via [[BLASTER GATE]] from September 17th, 2020.
* IX's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* IX is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* In the DanceDanceRevolution series prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], IX's BPM was displayed as 99-396.
* IX is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).
* IX is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium location ③'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアムロケ③) route. It can be unlocked from January 8th, 2026.
* IX's HARD and INFLUENCE charts were re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

