== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Daily Lunch Special is the first FINAL STAGE song of REFLEC BEAT colette -Winter-.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Daily Lunch Special was playable by default.
* Daily Lunch Special is Yoshitaka Nishimura's last song in REFLEC BEAT composed and arranged entirely by himself that is not a crossover/event unlock.
** It also marks the final use of his Lucky Vacuum alias.
* Daily Lunch Special is one of jubeat saucer's ''Only Now Songs'' (いまだけ楽曲). It could be unlocked from December 3rd to 10th, 2012.
** From December 11th, 2012, it could be unlocked via ''bistro saucer''.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** It could also be unlocked from November 2nd to December 7th, 2020 as one of the unlocks of jubeat festo's ''T-emo STORE''.
*** It could also be unlocked in jubeat festo from February 17th, 2021 as the ''Kotaro's memories PHASE LINE 1'' unlock of the ''Mission Travel'' unlocking system.
** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
* Daily Lunch Special's jubeat charts were created by RAG [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=7].
* Daily Lunch Special appears in pop'n music Sunny Park as part of the [[Q-pro, Mimi, Nyami & Pastel-kun no minna de uchuu sensou!!]] (クプロ・ミミニャミ・パステルくんのみんなで宇宙戦争!!) unlock event, which started on July 29th, 2013.
** In [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]], it could be unlocked through the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki]] (発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡) event.
** From July 23rd, 2015, it could be unlocked in pop'n music ラピストリア via Story Mode.
** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 60 lumina.
** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
* Daily Lunch Special was added to DanceDanceRevolution (2013) on January 31st, 2014, as part of the [[Nettou! BEMANI Stadium]] (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム) event.
** Since July 24th, 2014, Daily Lunch Special can be unlocked via ''EXTRA ATTACK'' in [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]].
** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* From DanceDanceRevolution (2014) onwards, Daily Lunch Special appears in the DanceDanceRevolution (2014) folder instead of the (2013) folder.
* Daily Lunch Special is one of the Phase 3 unlockable songs of the ''Mystery Line'' event of beatmania IIDX 23 copula. It could be unlocked from July 21st, 2016.
** In beatmania IIDX, Daily Lunch Special's genre appears in Japanese.
** In [[AC SINOBUZ|beatmania IIDX 24 SINOBUZ]], its charts can be purchased with [[AC SINOBUZ/Kinran no omamori unlocks|Kinran no omamori]] (金襴のお守り) from December 14th, 2016.
** From [[AC CANNON BALLERS|beatmania IIDX 25 CANNON BALLERS]] onwards, it is available by default.
* Daily Lunch Special received an alternate jacket on the [http://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/music/201607/?___REDIRECT=1|BEMANI| BEMANI Fan Site CHECK!SONGS page for July 2016]. This jacket has not yet been used in a BEMANI game.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Daily Lunch Special was revived on December 15th, 2016. 
** Its WHITE HARD chart could be unlocked through a quest in Reflesia Mode (リフレシアモード).
*** As of March 23rd, 2017, it is available by default.
* Daily Lunch Special was one of the qualifying round songs in [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|The 6th KONAMI Arcade Championship]] for REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア.
* Daily Lunch Special is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.10''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.10).
* Daily Lunch Special's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Daily Lunch Special is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* Daily Lunch Special [ 2 ] is one of the unlocks of jubeat Ave.'s ''STAR RECORD''. It could be unlocked from February 8th to 28th, 2023 by lighting up 20 stars.
** In [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|jubeat beyond the Ave.]], it can be unlocked from November 1st, 2024 by playing the song thrice as a BONUS TUNE.
* Daily Lunch Special is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (pop'n music Lively REFLEC BEATセレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).

