== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Elemental Creation is the final [[Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen]] (私立BEMANI学園) song. To unlock it, you must first have unlocked all the other 9 Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen songs, and then get 100% of Friendship on dj TAKA and DJ YOSHITAKA. After the event ended, it can be unlocked through different systems, depending on the BEMANI game:
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], it could be automatically unlocked after 30 play sessions until July 24th, 2014.
*** From July 24th, 2014 up until June 25th, 2015, it could be unlocked via the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and [[AC PENDUAL|beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL]].
*** Since July 1st, 2015 in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL, it could be obtained by purchasing the ''BEMANI学園'' pack (which includes all 私立BEMANI学園 songs) for 7000 FRICO.
*** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, it is available by default.
** In DanceDanceRevolution (2013) and [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]], it could be automatically unlocked after 10 play sessions. Its CHALLENGE charts could be unlocked after a play session after having unlocked Elemental Creation.
*** From [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]] onwards, Elemental Creation and its CHALLENGE charts are available by default.
** In jubeat saucer, it could be unlocked via the ''bistro saucer'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it could be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it could be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** As of [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is available by default.
** In pop'n music Sunny Park, it could be unlocked in the [[AC pnm Sunny Park/Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen|Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen]] (わいわいポップン動物園) unlocking event from December 19th, 2013.
*** In [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]], it could be unlocked via Story Mode from July 9th, 2014.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 100 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB colette All Seasons|REFLEC BEAT colette -All Seasons-]], it could be unlocked after a play session.
*** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|VOLZZA 2]], it was unlocked by default.
* Elemental Creation was first leaked in DanceDanceRevolution (2013) some days before the 私立BEMANI学園 event started due to a bug. It was later fixed by an update.
* During the duration of the 私立BEMANI学園 event, Elemental Creation's DanceDanceRevolution CHALLENGE charts could be accessed as an EXTRA STAGE by having cleared all other 私立BEMANI学園 songs.
* Elemental Creation's DanceDanceRevolution charts switch between 106, 212, and 424 BPM, running at 424 BPM for the majority of the song. In all other BEMANI games that it appears in, Elemental Creation's charts run at a constant 212 BPM.
* In ポップンリズミン, Elemental Creation's EX chart holds the record with the most number of notes of any ポップンリズミン chart, with 951 notes.
* Elemental Creation's jubeat charts were created by RAG [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=8].
** At the time when Elemental Creation came out, jubeat's bonus score calculation formula couldn't handle a chart with more than 1024 notes (players would need to almost get an all PERFECT or GREAT to get a full bonus score). This makes Elemental Creation's EXTREME chart essentially having the max notecount at that time, with 1023 notes.
*** This bug could be seen in Elemental Creation -GITADO ROCK ver.-'s EXTREME chart in jubeat plus, which has 1038 notes. The bug was later fixed.
* The statue that can be seen on Elemental Creation's jacket is Tadao, the principal of the 私立BEMANI学園 (whose role is played by Takayuki Ishikawa himself).
** In pop'n music, Elemental Creation's MZD has a moustache, referencing Tadao.
* Despite that MZD has a new design, none of the 私立BEMANI学園 songs have new comments on the pop'n music Sunny Park MUSIC&CHARACTERS page.
* Elemental Creation's EX chart has a [[Spicy Gauge]].
* Elemental Creation was one of the qualifying round songs in the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2013]] for DanceDanceRevolution (2013).
* Elemental Creation received a BEGINNER chart in [[AC PENDUAL|beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL]].
* Elemental Creation's EASY chart was re-rated in pop'n music éclale on March 22nd, 2016.
* Elemental Creation's timing was slightly fixed on the September 13th, 2016 update of [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]].
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Elemental Creation was revived on July 14th, 2017.
* Elemental Creation could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN by collecting 30 stamps from October 4th to October 28th, 2018.
** In [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]], it can be purchased with PCB from June 27th, 2019.
* Elemental Creation is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.3''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.3).
* Elemental Creation was added to [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s REGULAR course on August 1st, 2019.
** It is also available in GRAVITY WARS コナステ's INFINITE course and [[CS SDVX EG|EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from February 5th, 2020, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.8''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.8).
* Elemental Creation is available in [[CS NST Konasute|コナステ ノスタルジア]] by purchasing '''Konasute NOSTALGIA Music Pack vol.5 ～Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen～''' (コナステ ノスタルジア 楽曲パック vol.5 ～私立BEMANI学園～).
* Elemental Creation is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.3's ''Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai Vol.III'' (時を巡る音楽祭　Vol.III) event, initially available for unlock from September 2nd to October 21st, 2021 (originally until September 30th, 2021). For more information on the dates when the event was revived, please see [[AC NST Op.3#Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai|this page]].
** From October 10th, 2024, it is permanently available for unlock.
* Elemental Creation received a Real chart in ノスタルジア Op.3 on September 2nd, 2021.
* Elemental Creation is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 1st, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.3''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.3).
* Elemental Creation's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Elemental Creation is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.14''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.14).
* Elemental Creation is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''BEMANI gakuen -koutoubu- location'' (BEMANI学園-高等部-ロケ) route. It can be unlocked from March 27th, 2025.
* Elemental Creation appears in SEGA's ''CHUNITHM'' music game series.

