== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* Engraved Mark is part of Des-ROW/D-crew's "Mark" song series.
* A re-arranged version of Engraved Mark is used in beatmania IIDX, jubeat, SOUND VOLTEX, and the [[Nettou! BEMANI Stadium ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK|熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK]].
* The GuitarFreaks & DrumMania version of Engraved Mark is a rock arrangement of the version found in the other BEMANI games. However, its title and jacket are unchanged.
** In the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK album, this version of Engraved Mark is titled '''Engraved Mark (GITADORA Ver.)'''.
* An extended version of Engraved Mark arranged by just Ryu☆ himself, titled ''Engraved Mark (Ryu☆Mix)'', appears in Ryu☆'s sixth album, [[We're so Happy (album)|We're so Happy]].
* A remix of Engraved Mark by [[Gowrock]], titled [[Engraved Mark -Gow's ill! RMX-]], appears in [[AC SDVX IV|SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN]].

== Trivia ==
* Engraved Mark is a song part of the ''Let's start with BEMANI apps campaign!'' (アプリでビーマニはじめようキャンペーン!) event. To unlock it, you must have GITADORA (Mobile), jubeat plus, ポップンリズミン, and REFLEC BEAT plus installed in your device.
** To unlock it in GITADORA (Mobile), you must tap on the Campaign (キャンペーン) button at the main screen, and then tap the BEMANI App Starting Campaign! banner. After the app check, Engraved Mark will be fully unlocked in Collection Mode.
** To unlock it in jubeat plus or REFLEC BEAT plus, you must tap the Present button on the Music Store. After the app check, Engraved Mark will be available to play.
** To unlock it in ポップンリズミン, you must accept the present at the main screen. After the app check, Engraved Mark will be available in GAME MODE.
* Engraved Mark marks the first collaboration between Ryutaro Nakahara and Osamu Migitera in BEMANI.
* Engraved Mark is one of the songs part of the Second Half of the [[Nettou! BEMANI Stadium]] (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム) event. It was added on January 23rd, 2014.
** To unlock its tournament, you had to link ポップンリズミン to your [[e-amusement|eAMUSEMENT]] account, and then play Engraved Mark on it once.
** Since March 5th, 2014, this tournament is available for everyone to access.
*** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
**** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
*** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from August 26th, 2014.
**** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
**** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
**** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
**** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
**** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
*** From March 16th, 2015, it could be unlocked in [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]] via Story Mode.
**** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 60 lumina.
**** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
*** In [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] and [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]], Engraved Mark could be purchased from the REFLEC Shop after clearing it in the BEMANI Stadium Test (BEMANIスタジアム検定) added on July 24th, 2014.
**** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Engraved Mark is playable by default.
* Engraved Mark marks Osamu Migitera's first appearance on the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* Engraved Mark is the first song that appeared in GITADORA (Mobile) before an arcade release of GuitarFreaks & DrumMania.
** It is also the first ポップンリズミン original song that appears on an arcade release of pop'n music.
* From [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]] onwards, Engraved Mark appears in the DanceDanceRevolution (2014) folder instead of the (2013) folder.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Engraved Mark displays its jacket (with the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム logo) when selected.
* Engraved Mark's EASY chart was re-rated in pop'n music éclale on March 22nd, 2016.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Engraved Mark was revived on November 15th, 2018.
* Engraved Mark is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.6''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.6).
* Engraved Mark's difficulty level changes from DanceDanceRevolution A20 were applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.
* Engraved Mark's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Engraved Mark is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* Engraved Mark is available in [[CS GD Konasute|コナステ GITADORA]] by purchasing '''Konasute GITADORA Tokubetsu kikaku SELECTION PACK vol.3''' (コナステ GITADORA 特別企画セレクションパック vol.3).
* Engraved Mark is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium location ③'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアムロケ③) route. It can be unlocked from January 8th, 2026.
* Engraved Mark's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

