* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], HYENA was revived on April 5th, 2018.
* HYENA is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.7''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.7).
* HYENA's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* HYENA received an EXCEED chart in [[AC SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR]]'s [[AC SDVX EG/ARENA STATION|ARENA STATION]], available since April 25th, 2022. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked, please see the event page.
** This chart is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from March 26th, 2025, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED EFFECT Pack''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED譜面パック).
