* HYENA is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* HYENA is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).
* HYENA received LEGGENDARIA charts in [[AC Pinky Crush|beatmania IIDX 32 Pinky Crush]]'s ARENA MODE. They can be unlocked from February 20th, 2025 through March 5th, 2025 by collecting 120 ARENA CUBES.
** In [[AC Sparkle Shower|beatmania IIDX 33 Sparkle Shower]], these charts can be purchased with [[AC Sparkle Shower/Hizou no record|Hizou no record]] (秘蔵のレコード) from January 8th, 2026.
* HYENA is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium location'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアムロケ) route. It can be unlocked from August 7th, 2025.
