* An extended version of Squeeze, titled ''Squeeze -Extended Mix-'', can be found on VENUS' first album, [[DEUS]]. Unlike the game size version of Squeeze, Squeeze -Extended Mix- features vocals by Yoshitaka and [[Yasuhiro Taguchi|TAG]].

== Trivia ==
* Squeeze is one of the songs part of the Second Half of the [[Nettou! BEMANI Stadium]] (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム) event.
** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
*** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from August 26th, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
*** In [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] and [[AC jb beyond the Ave.|beyond the Ave.]], it is one of the CONCIERGE unlocks of the ''LIGHT CHAT'' unlocking system from August 17th, 2022.
** From March 16th, 2015, it could be unlocked in [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]] via Story Mode.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 60 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] and [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]], Squeeze can be purchased from the REFLEC Shop after clearing it in the BEMANI Stadium Test (BEMANIスタジアム検定) added on July 24th, 2014.
*** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Squeeze is playable by default.
* Squeeze marks the first VENUS song in BEMANI that does not have sung vocals.
* Squeeze is the first original VENUS song in the beatmania IIDX, DanceDanceRevolution, jubeat, SOUND VOLTEX, and ミライダガッキ FutureTomTom series.
** It also marks the first appearances of either Sota Fujimori or Mutsuhiko Izumi in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* Yoshitaka Nishimura, Sota Fujimori, and Mutsuhiko Izumi appear on Squeeze's jacket.
* In pop'n music, instead of displaying its character's portrait, Squeeze displays its jacket (with the 熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム logo) when selected.
* Squeeze's pop'n music songwheel genre, ウィザウチュナイ-ゼクス-, reads as "WITHOUT YOU TONIGHT -SECHS-".
* Squeeze's genre in beatmania IIDX was written as '''WITHOUT YOU NIGHT -VI-'''. This was fixed on March 27th, 2014.
* Squeeze currently has the highest rated difficulties of any VENUS song in the beatmania IIDX, pop'n music, REFLEC BEAT, and jubeat series.
* Squeeze might be named after the squeeze play, a maneuver in baseball.
* From [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]] onwards, Squeeze appears in the DanceDanceRevolution (2014) folder instead of the (2013) folder.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Squeeze was revived on December 20th, 2018.
* Squeeze is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.7''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.7).
* Squeeze is unlockable in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] from April 13th, 2022 as part of the ''pop'n quest'' (ポップンクエスト) unlocking system.
* Squeeze's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Squeeze is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* Squeeze is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium location ②'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアムロケ②) route. It can be unlocked from October 23rd, 2025.
* Squeeze's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

