* Stella Sinistra is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.3's ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアム) event, initially available for unlock from August 6th to 18th, 2020. For more information on the dates when the event was revived, please see [[AC NST Op.3#Nettou! BEMANI Stadium|this page]].
** From August 8th, 2024, it is permanently available for unlock.
* Stella Sinistra received a Real chart in ノスタルジア Op.3 on September 23rd, 2020.
