* Stella Sinistra is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from August 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.9''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.9).
* In jubeat Ave., Stella Sinistra was incorrectly categorized under [[Youhei Kimura|ARM]]'s Artist category. This was fixed on September 13th, 2022.
* Stella Sinistra is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Selection Music Pack vol.4''' (pop'n music Lively セレクション 楽曲パック vol.4).
* Stella Sinistra is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''Nettou! BEMANI Stadium location'' (熱闘！BEMANIスタジアムロケ) route. It can be unlocked from August 7th, 2025.
