== Trivia ==
* Synergy For Angels is one of the [[Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen]] (私立BEMANI学園) songs. To unlock it, you must get 100% of Friendship on TAG and U1-ASAMi. After the event ended, it can be unlocked through different systems, depending on the BEMANI game:
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], it could be automatically unlocked after 27 play sessions until July 24th, 2014.
*** From July 24th, 2014 up until June 25th, 2015, it could be unlocked via the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and [[AC PENDUAL|beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL]].
*** Since July 1st, 2015 in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL, it could be obtained by purchasing the ''BEMANI学園'' pack (which includes all 私立BEMANI学園 songs) for 7000 FRICO.
*** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, it is available by default.
** In DanceDanceRevolution (2013) and [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]], it could be automatically unlocked after 1 play session.
*** From [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]] onwards, it is available by default.
** In jubeat saucer, it could be unlocked via the ''bistro saucer'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it could be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it could be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** As of [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is available by default by playing with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In pop'n music Sunny Park, it could be unlocked in the [[AC pnm Sunny Park/Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen|Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen]] (わいわいポップン動物園) unlocking event from December 19th, 2013.
*** In [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]], it could be unlocked via Story Mode from July 9th, 2014.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 60 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB colette All Seasons|REFLEC BEAT colette -All Seasons-]], it could be unlocked after a play session.
*** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|VOLZZA 2]], it was unlocked by default.
* Synergy For Angels marks the first collaboration between Yasuhiro Taguchi and Yuichi Asami in BEMANI.
** It also marks Yuichi Asami's first appearance in jubeat, his non-crossover appearance in the pop'n music series, and, along with [[Nostalgia Is Lost]], his debut on the REFLEC BEAT series.
** Both artists appear on Synergy For Angels' jacket.
* Despite that MZD has a new design, none of the 私立BEMANI学園 songs have new comments on the pop'n music Sunny Park MUSIC&CHARACTERS page.
* Synergy For Angels could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN by collecting 11 stamps from October 4th to October 28th, 2018.
** In [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]], it can be purchased with PCB from June 27th, 2019.
* Synergy For Angels is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.3''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.3).
* Synergy For Angels was added to [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s REGULAR course on August 1st, 2019.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Synergy For Angels was revived on March 12th, 2020.
* Synergy For Angels is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 1st, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.3''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.3).
* Synergy For Angels' [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* Synergy For Angels is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from December 9th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.21''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.21).
* Synergy For Angels is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.14''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.14).
* Synergy For Angels is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''BEMANI gakuen -koutoubu- location'' (BEMANI学園-高等部-ロケ) route. It can be unlocked from March 27th, 2025.
* Synergy For Angels' INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

