* Windy Fairy is one of the unlockable songs of the first Phase of REFLEC BEAT colette -Spring-'s ''Pastel Adventure'' colette Garden unlocking system. To obtain it, you must get the third Song Seed (楽曲のたね その3) from colette Garden's Order Shop.
