== Trivia ==
* ラキラキ is one of the [[Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen]] (私立BEMANI学園) songs. To unlock it, you must get 100% of Friendship on Mutsuhiko Izumi and S-C-U. After the event ended, it can be unlocked through different systems, depending on the BEMANI game:
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], it could be automatically unlocked after 24 play sessions until July 24th, 2014.
*** From July 24th, 2014 up until June 25th, 2015, it could be unlocked via the [[Hakken! Yomigaetta BEMANI iseki|発見！よみがえったBEMANI遺跡]] event in beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA and [[AC PENDUAL|beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL]].
*** Since July 1st, 2015 in beatmania IIDX 22 PENDUAL, it could be obtained by purchasing the ''BEMANI学園'' pack (which includes all 私立BEMANI学園 songs) for 7000 FRICO.
*** From [[AC copula|beatmania IIDX 23 copula]] onwards, it is available by default.
** In DanceDanceRevolution (2013) and [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]], it could be automatically unlocked after 3 play sessions.
*** From [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]] onwards, it is available by default.
** In jubeat saucer, it could be unlocked via the ''bistro saucer'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it could be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it could be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** As of [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is available by default by playing with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** In pop'n music Sunny Park, it could be unlocked in the [[AC pnm Sunny Park/Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen|Waiwai pop'n doubutsuen]] (わいわいポップン動物園) unlocking event from December 19th, 2013.
*** In [[AC pnm Lapistoria|pop'n music ラピストリア]], it could be unlocked via Story Mode from July 9th, 2014.
*** In [[AC pnm eclale|pop'n music éclale]], it could be purchased from the Star Factory shop for 60 lumina.
*** As of [[AC pnm Usaneko|pop'n music うさぎと猫と少年の夢]], it is available by default.
** In [[AC RB colette All Seasons|REFLEC BEAT colette -All Seasons-]], it could be unlocked after a play session.
*** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|VOLZZA 2]], it was unlocked by default.
* ラキラキ marks Mutsuhiko Izumi's first original composition in both the DanceDanceRevolution and REFLEC BEAT series.
** It also marks his first new song in beatmania IIDX since [[HALF MOON]] in [[AC GOLD|beatmania IIDX 14 GOLD]].
* Despite that MZD has a new design, none of the 私立BEMANI学園 songs have new comments on the pop'n music Sunny Park MUSIC&CHARACTERS page.
* ラキラキ's jubeat charts were created by [[Hiroyuki Masuda|まっする]] [https://p.eagate.573.jp/game/bemani/fansite/p/report/2014w/report12.html?page=8].
* In jukebeat, ラキラキ's title was changed to '''RAKIRAKI'''.
* ラキラキ's title has a double meaning - in addition to simply being the phrase "lucky lucky" written in katakana, it also happens to be the Japanese word ''kirakira'' (キラキラ), meaning "sparkling" or "glitter", spelled backwards.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], ラキラキ was revived on September 13th, 2018.
* ラキラキ could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX IV HEAVENLY HAVEN by collecting 1 stamp from October 4th to October 28th, 2018.
** In [[AC SDVX VW|SOUND VOLTEX VIVID WAVE]], it can be purchased with PCB from June 27th, 2019.
* ラキラキ was added to [[CS SDVX III|SOUND VOLTEX III GRAVITY WARS コナステ]]'s REGULAR course on August 1st, 2019.
* ラキラキ is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] from February 3rd, 2021 after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* ラキラキ is available in [[CS NST Konasute|コナステ ノスタルジア]] by purchasing '''Konasute NOSTALGIA Music Pack vol.5 ～Shiritsu BEMANI gakuen～''' (コナステ ノスタルジア 楽曲パック vol.5 ～私立BEMANI学園～).
* ラキラキ is one of the unlocks of ノスタルジア Op.3's ''Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai Vol.III'' (時を巡る音楽祭　Vol.III) event, initially available for unlock from July 21st to October 21st, 2021 (originally until September 30th, 2021). For more information on the dates when the event was revived, please see [[AC NST Op.3#Toki wo meguru ongaku-sai|this page]].
** From October 10th, 2024, it is permanently available for unlock.
* ラキラキ is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 1st, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.3''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.3).
* ラキラキ's [[CS jb 2021|jubeat (2021)]] ratings were adjusted to its jubeat festo ratings on March 7th, 2022.
* ラキラキ is available in [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] by purchasing '''pop'n music Lively Music Pack vol.14''' (pop'n music Lively 楽曲パック vol.14).
* ラキラキ is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from September 19th, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* ラキラキ is one of the unlocks of ポラリスコード's ''Hakkutsu! Caravan universe'' (発掘！キャラバンユニバース) event, through the ''BEMANI gakuen -shotoubu- location'' (BEMANI学園-初等部-ロケ) route. It can be unlocked from March 27th, 2025.
* ラキラキ's INFLUENCE chart was re-rated in ポラリスコード on March 23rd, 2026.

