== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- and [[SILVER DREAM|SILVER☆DREAM]] are the hidden boss songs of DanceDanceRevolution HOTTEST PARTY2 / [[CS DDR FuruFuruParty|フルフル♪パーティー]].
* In DanceDanceRevolution HOTTEST PARTY2 / フルフル♪パーティー, osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- uses the ''Double Stomp'' gimmick.
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- was the second ''EXTRA TOUR'' song in DanceDanceRevolution X3 VS 2ndMIX. It could be played as an EXTRA STAGE since May 16th, 2012.
** As of September 26th, 2012, osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- has been unlocked for normal play.
** It received Double charts in DanceDanceRevolution X3 VS 2ndMIX.
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!-'s TYPE1, TYPE2, and TYPE3 were known as Ver.A, Ver.B, and Ver.C respectively in DanceDanceRevolution HOTTEST PARTY2.
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!-'s title is written as '''osaka EVOLVED -MAIDO, OHKINI!-''' in international releases of the DanceDanceRevolution series before [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]].
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- is the third song to have a BEGINNER chart rated Level 9, after [[Fascination ~eternal love mix~|Fascination ～eternal love mix～]] and [[Valkyrie dimension]].
* Osaka (大阪) is the capital city of Osaka Prefecture of Japan's main island of Honshu. Osaka is Japan's third largest city by population after Tokyo and Yokohama, and is historically the commercial center of Japan.
** Osaka is also Naoki Maeda's home city.
** The "おおきに!" (ohkini!) in the subtitle is a slang word for "thank you" in Osaka dialect.
** The tower both in the jacket and banner is Tsutenkaku (通天閣), the landmark tower of Osaka.
* osaka EVOLVED -毎度、おおきに!- is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from June 24th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.7''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.7).

