== Trivia ==
* ビューティフル レシート is unlocked in REFLEC BEAT limelight by reaching the final part of Glass Stage 3-3.
** In [[AC RB colette|REFLEC BEAT colette]], it is unlocked by reaching Stage 2 of Pastel Adventure (パステルアドベンチャー) in limelight Mountain.
** From [[AC RB groovin'!!|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!]] to [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], ビューティフル レシート was playable by default.
* ビューティフル レシート marks Yoshitaka Nishimura's only original song for the DanceDanceRevolution series using the Lucky Vacuum alias.
* ビューティフル レシート is the first song of [[Lincle LINK]] 5 to be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle. It becomes available once Q-pro Level 5 on beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle has been reached.
** In [[AC SPADA|beatmania IIDX 21 SPADA]], it has been automatically unlocked as of May 14th, 2014 by using an [[e-amusement|eAMUSEMENT]] PASS.
* According to DJ YOSHITAKA, ビューティフル レシート was originally planned to run at 145 BPM.
* On the receipt found in ビューティフル レシート's jacket, it is written:
** The name of the shop, "Roppongi RB Market".
** The address of the official website of REFLEC BEAT.
** A "Thank you for purchasing!" message.
** The list of bought items: a lime for 112 yen, a DJ YOSHITAKA Single for 541 yen and light bulbs for 124 yen. In total, 777 yen. 777 is a number related to luck, referencing the artist's alias.
** The 7's that appear on the receipt's issue date and time of Thursday, July 7 (07/07), 2011 at 7:07 AM also refers to luck.
** The '''lime''' and '''light'''bulb on the receipt may refer to REFLEC BEAT limelight, one of the games where ビューティフル レシート debuted.
* ビューティフル レシート was one of the preliminary round songs in the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2012]] for REFLEC BEAT limelight.
* ビューティフル レシート received a brand new BEGINNER chart in [[AC tricoro|beatmania IIDX 20 tricoro]].
* ビューティフル レシート is available in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] by purchasing '''beatmania IIDX INFINITAS Music Pack vol.2''' (beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 楽曲パック vol.2).
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], ビューティフル レシート was revived on May 24th, 2018.
* ビューティフル レシート is one of the unlocks of jubeat festo's ''T-emo STORE''. It could be purchased from September 7th to October 5th, 2020.
** From [[AC jb Ave.|jubeat Ave.]] onwards, it is available by default with an [[e-amusement]] pass.
* ビューティフル レシート received new charts in the arcade jubeat games.
* ビューティフル レシート is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from May 25th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.20''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.20).
* ビューティフル レシート could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from May 29th to July 7th, 2025, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 15 stamps.
** Since February 12th, 2026 in [[AC SDVX NABLA|SOUND VOLTEX ∇]], it can be purchased with BLOCKs.
* ビューティフル レシート is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from January 21st, 2026, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX Music Pack vol.26''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX 楽曲パック vol.26).

== Song Production Information ==
=== Lucky Vacuum ===
Luck is so important in life, right?!<br>
That's why you can't help but get hyped over a 777-yen receipt!<br>
I mean, I originally submitted the demo at 145 BPM, but seeing how things were going, of course I'd raise the BPM!<br>
And in the end, it definitely feels like speeding it up was the right call! Yeah, keeping it positive!

