== Song Production Information ==
=== StripE ===
I tried producing something called "Russian Trance", which I've been hearing a lot about in the recent Japanese trance scene.<br>
Does it feel like Mayim Mayim?<br>
Does it feel like the song Неделька?<br>
Anyways, when you think of Russia, you think of Cossack dancing.<br>
The image of many macho men doing Cossack dancing around a bonfire wouldn't leave my mind, and despite struggling, I somehow managed to bring it to completion.<br>
Please enjoy the unique melody and sense of speed.

== Video Production Information ==
=== GOLI ===
Hey~ are you on fire~? By the way, "moe" has become such a common term suddently.<br>
Personally, I like this song. It's something I remember humming at night in the bathtub.

