== Song Production Information ==
=== beatmania IIDX ===
==== Ryu☆ ====
"I'm so Happy" was created as a boss song for jubeat knit.<br>
After being crossed over to "Dance Dance Revolution X2", it finally appeared in "beatmania IIDX 19 Lincle".<br>
This is all thanks to everyone's support. Thank you so much.

In terms of sound, I arranged this song to be strongly conscious of UK HARDCORE with female vocals as its core, which mixing a melancholic feeling with an intense beat/groove.

Also, several long versions of this song exist,

"jubeat knit APPEND SOUNDTRACK" includes the "Extended Mix"<br>
[https://web.archive.org/web/20120926171719/http://www.konamistyle.jp/sp/jubeat_knit_append/index.html http://www.konamistyle.jp/sp/jubeat_knit_append/index.html]

Ryu☆3rdAlbum "Rainbow☆Rainbow" includes the "Extended RRver", and the "feat. Lucky Vacuum" version is in "cyber beatnation 2 -Hi Speed conclusion-"<br>
[https://web.archive.org/web/20120614151350/http://www.konamistyle.jp/item/71571 http://www.konamistyle.jp/item/71571]

Each long version has a different style, so by all means, I'd be happy if you listened to all three versions.

