== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* roppongi EVOLVED is part of the "EVOLVED" song series.
* roppongi EVOLVED has four different versions (roppongi EVOLVED ver.A, ver.B, ver.C, and ver.D), which share the same intro part.
** roppongi EVOLVED ver.A appears in the [[DanceDanceRevolution ULTIMATE DANCE COLLECTION -MANIA-|DanceDanceRevolution ULTIMATE DANCE COLLECTION — MANIA —]] album, while roppongi EVOLVED ver.D appears in the [[DanceDanceRevolution X2 Original Soundtrack]] album. Both versions are simply titled '''roppongi EVOLVED''' in their respective albums.
* roppongi EVOLVED is one of the songs sampled in [[DDR TAGMIX -LAST DanceR-]], from [[AC DDR A20 PLUS|DanceDanceRevolution A20 PLUS]].

== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* roppongi EVOLVED is the regular ENCORE EXTRA STAGE song of DanceDanceRevolution X2. To access it, you must clear [[KIMONO PRINCESS|KIMONO♥PRINCESS]] on EXPERT as an EXTRA STAGE with a grade of at least AA. One of the four versions of roppongi EVOLVED will be loaded randomly.
** When selecting roppongi EVOLVED as an ENCORE EXTRA STAGE song, both the [[GROOVE RADAR]] and BPM display in the music select screen disappear.
** As of January 26th, 2011, roppongi EVOLVED's four versions can be played on any stage.
* roppongi EVOLVED marks Yasuhiro Taguchi's first use of his TAG underground alias.
* roppongi EVOLVED is the only song of the EVOLVED series that has four versions.
* roppongi EVOLVED's BPM changes are as follows:
** ver.A: 170.
** ver.B: 170&rarr;85&rarr;170.
** ver.C: 170&rarr;85&rarr;42.5&rarr;(stop)&rarr;42.5&rarr;85&rarr;170&rarr;(stop)&rarr;170&rarr;(stop)&rarr;170.
** ver.D: 170&rarr;(ten stops)&rarr;170&rarr;340&rarr;680&rarr;340&rarr;170&rarr;85&rarr;170&rarr;(six stops)&rarr;170&rarr;(stop)&rarr;170.
** In all pre-[[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] releases, the displayed BPM for all versions of roppongi EVOLVED and all of their difficulties is 170.
* roppongi EVOLVED ver.D is the only version that has a unique background video, which is displayed in the background of the MOVIE background dance stage's white variant and is not full-screen in all pre-DanceDanceRevolution WORLD releases.
** This video reuses four DDRMAX-EXTREME background movies.
** roppongi EVOLVED ver.D's video is absent in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, causing this version to be played on the CYBER stage instead like with all other versions.
* Roppongi (六本木) is a district of Minato, Tokyo, Japan, well-known as home to the rich Roppongi Hills area and an active night club scene.
* roppongi EVOLVED's charts were created by TAG himself [https://mond.how/ja/topics/isgh37192pd9ip2].
* roppongi EVOLVED ver.C was one of the qualifying round songs in the [[KONAMI Arcade Championship|KONAMI Arcade Championship 2013]] for [[AC DDR 2013|DanceDanceRevolution (2013)]].
* roppongi EVOLVED ver.A, ver.B, and ver.C are available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from September 26th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.10''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.10).
* roppongi EVOLVED ver.D is available in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode from February 20th, 2023, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.16''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.16).

