== Song Production Information ==
=== Ryu☆ ===
Hello-nichiwa, DDR fans! Ryu☆ here.<br>
This time around, I've contributed "Sakura Sunrise", the second installment in my Sakura series.<br>
I received a passionate request from sound director [[Yasuhiro Taguchi|TAG]] saying, "Pleeeeeeeease give us a sequel to [[sakura storm]]!", so I put my absolute all into answering that call!<br>
I'm proud to say that it turned out with an even more upbeat vibe than sakura storm.<br>
I hope you will enjoy stepping to the groove while feeling the beauty of Japan!

