== Trivia ==
* 不沈艦CANDY is one of the three Sweets ONE MORE EXTRA STAGE songs from beatmania IIDX 16 EMPRESS.
* "Fuchinkan" (不沈艦) means "unsinkable warship".
* 不沈艦CANDY received a new BEGINNER chart in [[AC SIRIUS|beatmania IIDX 17 SIRIUS]].
* Prior to [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], 不沈艦CANDY's music video is shown in the background of the BIG SCREEN dance stage and is not full-screen.
** 不沈艦CANDY's video is absent in [[CS DDR II|DanceDanceRevolution II / hottest party5]].
** 不沈艦CANDY's video was removed from [[AC DDR 2013|DanceDanceRevolution (2013)]] on April 4th, 2013 due to technical issues. It was later restored on July 30th, 2013, now playing in the background of the WHITE MOVIE stage instead.
* 不沈艦CANDY's video and jacket contain the text "2gorgeous4u", which coincidentally is the title of [[2 gorgeous 4U|a song in beatmania]].
* In the American and European releases of the DanceDanceRevolution series before [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], 不沈艦CANDY's title was changed to '''YELLOW CANDY'''.
* 不沈艦CANDY was added to [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] on June 6th, 2018 as part of the June 2018 Basic Subscription Monthly Songs.
** From July 2020, it can be purchased with BITs.
* 不沈艦CANDY is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from March 22nd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.4''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.4).
* 不沈艦CANDY is one of the unlocks of the [[BEMANI noryosai 2026|BEMANI納涼祭2026]] event. It could be unlocked in jubeat beyond the Ave. from June 18th, 2026 to August 17th, 2026.
* 不沈艦CANDY received a slightly modified EXTREME chart in jubeat beyond the Ave. on June 19th, 2026 [https://x.com/jubeat_staff/status/2067527474624569386].

