== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* Übertreffen means "surpass" in German.
* Übertreffen is one of the songs part of Episode 6 of the ''Fever senshi pop'n 14'' (フィーバー戦士 ポップン14) event. It could be unlocked from August 9th to 23rd, 2006.
** From September 6th, 2006, it is available by default.
* Übertreffen is one of the EXTRA STAGE crossover songs of the ''MILITARY SPLASH #1'' unlock system. It could be unlocked in beatmania IIDX 15 DJ TROOPERS from March 26th, 2008.
** To play Übertreffen, clear 35 songs in the DJ TROOPERS folder, 30 of which must be on ANOTHER difficulty.
* Übertreffen received Black ANOTHER charts in [[CS DJ TROOPERS|beatmania IIDX 15 DJ TROOPERS CS]].
** These charts were later ported to [[AC CANNON BALLERS|beatmania IIDX 25 CANNON BALLERS]] as LEGGENDARIA charts. They can be unlocked from September 13th, 2018 by clearing the ''POP'' EXPERT course.
*** As of [[AC Rootage|beatmania IIDX 26 Rootage]], these charts are available by default.
*** These charts are available in [[CS INFINITAS 2020|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS (2020)]] since July 26th, 2023.
* Übertreffen was unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution X for normal play on May 21st, 2009.
* DanceDanceRevolution X's Information Mode does not mention that Übertreffen originated in pop'n music 14 FEVER!. Instead, it mentions beatmania IIDX 15 DJ TROOPERS.
* Übertreffen is listed on the DanceDanceRevolution master song list alongside other songs from [[AC DDR SuperNOVA2|DanceDanceRevolution SuperNOVA2]], suggesting it was planned to appear in that game first.
* Übertreffen is the 1st stage, Chapter 3 unlock of ノスタルジア's ''Haru no classical ensoukai'' (春のクラシック演奏会). It could be unlocked from April 19th to May 7th, 2017.
** It could be unlocked again from July 7th to 17th, 2017.
** It could be unlocked yet again from April 5th, 2018 to April 22nd, 2018.
** In [[AC NST Op.2|ノスタルジア Op.2]], it can be unlocked from February 7th, 2019 as part of the [[AC NST Op.2/Kaidan|Kaidan]] (階段) unlocking system.
** In [[AC NST Op.3|ノスタルジア Op.3]], it can be unlocked from June 11th, 2020 from the [[AC NST Op.3/Old Hidden Songs|ノスタルジアFORTE&Op.2 イベント]] section at the Episode selection screen.
* Übertreffen's LEGGENDARIA charts use a different generic video and feature brand-new overlays.
** This makes it the first, and currently only, LEGGENDARIA chart in beatmania IIDX to change the video of the song when playing the chart.
** Übertreffen's pop'n music character Wilhelm appears in these overlays.
* Übertreffen is unlockable in [[CS INFINITAS|beatmania IIDX INFINITAS]] from February 6th, 2019, after purchasing its charts with [[CS INFINITAS/BIT unlocks|BITs]].
* Übertreffen's Hard chart was re-rated on February 27th, 2019 in ノスタルジア Op.2.
* Übertreffen is one of the unlocks of the [[POLICY BREAK]] event. For more information on the dates it could be unlocked in the SOUND VOLTEX series, please see the event page.
** From April 25th, 2022 in [[AC SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR]], it can be purchased with PCB instead.
* GOLI is uncredited for Übertreffen's jacket in the SOUND VOLTEX series.
* A Real chart for Übertreffen was listed as one of the possible picks during the ノスタルジア Op.3 final round at The 9th [[KONAMI Arcade Championship]]. It was made available for purchase on June 26th, 2021.
* Übertreffen was added to [[CS pnm Lively|pop'n music Lively]] on November 5th, 2020 as the November 2020 Monthly Bonus Song.
** From October 27th, 2021, it can be unlocked via Ticket Quest after purchasing the song with two ''Lively Tickets'' (Livelyチケット).
* Übertreffen is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from July 20th, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.8''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.8).
* Übertreffen is available in [[CS SDVX EG|SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ]] from September 19th, 2024, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI Selection Music Pack vol.2''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX BEMANI セレクション 楽曲パック vol.2).
* Übertreffen received CHALLENGE charts in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]], unlockable from December 25th, 2024 through ''EXTRA SAVIOR WORLD'' after having unlocked ''all'' The 1st CLASSIC CHALLENGE charts.
** In DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX, these charts are available by default from December 25th, 2024.

