== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* CANDY☆ is the ONE MORE EXTRA STAGE song of DDRMAX -DanceDanceRevolution 6thMIX-. To play it, you must get at least a AA on the Single or Double HEAVY chart of [[MAX 300]] as EXTRA STAGE.
* According to Naoki's comment on the beatmania THE FINAL page for CANDY☆, it was written as a "pre-production" song for what became CANDY♥ in DDRMAX2.
* CANDY☆ has an alternate chart in [[CS DS Fusion PS2|Dancing Stage Fusion CS (PS2)]]'s MISSION mode Challenge #96.
* CANDY☆ received a Double BEGINNER chart in [[CS DDR ULTRAMIX3|DanceDanceRevolution ULTRAMIX3]].
* CANDY☆ received brand-new CHALLENGE charts in [[CS DDR UNIVERSE|DanceDanceRevolution UNIVERSE]]. These charts have never been used in an arcade DanceDanceRevolution release.
* '''CANDY☆(X-Special)''' is one of the X-Special ENCORE EXTRA STAGEs in [[AC DDR X|DanceDanceRevolution X]], which can be played from July 9th, 2009 by obtaining at least a AA on MAX 300(X-Special) as the EXTRA STAGE.
** As of October 1st, 2009, CANDY☆(X-Special) has been unlocked for normal play.
* From [[AC DDR X2|DanceDanceRevolution X2]] onwards, CANDY☆(X-Special) appears in the DanceDanceRevolution X folder instead of the DDRMAX folder.
* CANDY☆ received a different jacket in [[CS DDR UNIVERSE3|DanceDanceRevolution UNIVERSE3]].
* In DanceDanceRevolution ULTRAMIX3 and [[CS DS Unleashed3|Dancing Stage Unleashed3]], CANDY☆ is titled as '''CANDY ★'''.
** In [[CS DDR Disney Channel EDITION|DanceDanceRevolution Disney Channel EDITION]], CANDY☆'s title dropped the star symbol in its title, as such, the title now shown as '''Candy'''.
** In [[CS DDR Classroom Edition|DanceDanceRevolution Classroom Edition]], CANDY☆'s title was changed to '''CANDY "STAR"'''.
* CANDY☆ received a unique video in DanceDanceRevolution Disney Channel EDITION. This video is exclusive for Disney Channel EDITION, as such, has never been used in any other release of DanceDanceRevolution.
* CANDY☆ appears in the KONAMI arcade game ''THE★BishiBashi''.
* From June 1st, 2017 in [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]] to [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]], CANDY☆(X-Special) does not appear in the song selection screen if the player does not use an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** From [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] onwards, it is available by default for all players.
* In [[DDR SELECTION]], CANDY☆ uses its background animations from [[AC DDR EXTREME|DanceDanceRevolution EXTREME]] instead of its DDRMAX animations, despite fellow DDRMAX song MAX 300 using its original DDRMAX animations.
* CANDY☆ received new CHALLENGE charts in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode on September 18th, 2025, which become available by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX chart pack vol.4''' (グランプリ譜面パック vol.4).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, CANDY☆'s CHALLENGE charts could be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From September 30th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, they are available by default for all players.

