** From [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] onwards, it is available by default for all players.
* Healing Vision(X-Special)'s difficulty level change from [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]] was applied to DanceDanceRevolution A on March 27th, 2019.

== Song Production Information ==
=== NAOKI ===
There is a part of this era that is searching for healing. Dance and games may not need "healing" elements, but I intentionally interpreted my own "healing" elements of dance music, reducing the digital feeling synth sounds more than usual, while pushing the acoustic piano and xiao to the front, so it feels like the warmth of the raw sound has a Heal feeling. And the completed song is Healing Vision. However, like not having time in real life to "be able to heal", even in the game, the step sequence requires players to clear it at a high level with limited time so they can "be able to heal".

== CS Information Data ==
=== [[CS DDRMAX NA|DDRMAX -DanceDanceRevolution-]] ===
You have unlocked the song "Healing Vision" by DE-SIRE. By fusing opera-style vocals, jazzy and dark drum'n'bass beats and ambient melodies, the song has pioneered a new sound while being very relaxing and therapeutic for the mind. Have you checked out the faster "Angelic mix"?

== Staff Comments ==
I tried to use green, a healing color.

