== Song Production Information ==
=== beatmania 4thMIX 〜the beat goes on〜 Official Website ===
There's been demand to bring over popular DDR songs to beatmania. Thanks to the cooperation of the DDR Sound Staff, this has become a reality. We'd like to see other popular songs from BEMANI games get carried over to other games, and show off different sides to them.

=== beatmania 4thMIX Original Soundtracks ===
==== [[Reo Nagumo|reo]] ====
Here's another song from DDR. We'd like to see other popular songs from BEMANI games get carried over to other games, and show off different sides to them.<br>
Just like with [[KEEP ON MOVIN']], the DDR Sound Staff created a new version of this song so that it could be crossed over to this version of beatmania.

=== DanceDanceRevolution CS ===
This song appeared in "Dance Dance Revolution 2nd MIX".<br>
It requires you to clear HARD mode in the PS version of "Dance Dance Revolution" 500 times.<br>
This song has a high difficulty level, without thinking about its strict unlock requirements.

=== DanceDanceRevolution 2ndMIX ===
This remix version has a faster tempo. It's somehow 190 BPM! This sound is a collage of effected female vocal effects, fuzzy sound effects, and metallic sampling tone generators, which turned into a solid result.

=== [[CS DDR 2ndReMIX APPEND CLUB vol.2|DanceDanceRevolution 2ndReMIX APPEND CLUB VERSiON vol.2]] ===
Those who played DanceDanceRevolusion know the name "PARANOiA". In the first version of DanceDanceRevolusion2ndMIX, it was the most popular song and a wall for the players, a boss of bosses, which can only be danced by those who received a tremendous score.<br>
It was then included in beatmania 4thMIX, and even used in IIDXsubstream, it became possible to club play between DJs and dancers. It's difficulty level wasn't very high in beatmania4thMIX, but it boasts intense difficulty in beatmaniaIIDXsubstream.

DanceDanceRevolusion 2nd ReMIX append clubversion vol.2 was appended to include songs from beatmaniaIIDXsubstream, so this time, you can listen to a version which strongly retains the atmosphere of playing it in beatmania.

