==== NAOKI ====
The PARANOiA series was really supposed to end by 3rd MIX. However, due to requests for a sequel of the PARANOiA series, Rebirth was included. By returning to the starting point, PARANOiA Rebirth is a minor-changed version of the original PARANOiA, rather than a drastically evolved version, like [[PARANOIA EVOLUTION|PARANOiA EVOLUTION]] as its name suggests.

