==== NAOKI ====
I envisioned this song to have a hard difficulty level in the game from the beginning, so I had various ideas to create it.

I was particularly conscious of the step patterns, and put the most effort to create the best rhythmic composition during production. In my opinion, this song also highlights the musical elements of my own interpretation of jungle.

