== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* The legend of MAX is DanceDanceRevolution EXTREME's EXTRA STAGE. To access it, you must AA a HEAVY or ONI chart in the FINAL STAGE.
* Despite that The legend of MAX's BPM has been displayed as 83-333 from [[AC DDR SuperNOVA|DanceDanceRevolution SuperNOVA]] onwards, it actually speeds up to 667 BPM during the Freeze Arrows immediately before the slowdown and stop.
** In [[CS DDR ULTRAMIX3|DanceDanceRevolution ULTRAMIX3]] and [[CS DS Unleashed3|Dancing Stage Unleashed3]], its BPM is shown as 0-666 instead.
** The legend of MAX's charts are known to have timing issues, due to incorrect looping points in the track.
** At 667 BPM, The legend of MAX had the fastest BPM at any point in an arcade DanceDanceRevolution song, until it was beaten by [[Pluto Relinquish]]'s 800 BPM in [[AC DDR SuperNOVA2|DanceDanceRevolution SuperNOVA2]].
* The legend of MAX's background and jacket feature [[MAX 300]]'s and [[MAXX UNLIMITED]]'s background images. The background and jacket itself are based on [[AC DDRMAX|DDRMAX -DanceDanceRevolution 6thMIX-]]'s Ending 2 (Staff Roll).
* The legend of MAX received a Double BEGINNER chart in DanceDanceRevolution ULTRAMIX3.
* '''The legend of MAX(X-Special)''' was one of the X-Special EXTRA STAGEs in [[AC DDR X|DanceDanceRevolution X]], which could be played from August 20th, 2009 by obtaining a AA rank on a set of songs that appeared in DanceDanceRevolution EXTREME's ''LEGENDARY ROAD'' (伝説道) CHALLENGE course (MAX 300, MAXX UNLIMITED, [[Sakura|桜]], The legend of MAX, and [[PARANOIA survivor MAX]]), and then gaining access to the EXTRA STAGE.
** As of October 1st, 2009, The legend of MAX(X-Special) has been unlocked for normal play.
* From [[AC DDR X2|DanceDanceRevolution X2]] onwards, The legend of MAX(X-Special) appears in the DanceDanceRevolution X folder instead of the EXTREME folder.
* From June 1st, 2017 in [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]] to [[AC DDR A3|DanceDanceRevolution A3]], The legend of MAX(X-Special) does not appear in the song selection screen if the player does not use an [[e-amusement]] pass.
** From [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]] onwards, it is available by default for all players.
* The legend of MAX received CHALLENGE charts in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode on May 14th, 2026, which become available by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX chart pack vol.7''' (グランプリ譜面パック vol.7).
