== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* On the GUITARFREAKS 11thMIX & drummania 10thMIX location tests, Dragon Blade was one of the EXTRA STAGE songs alongside [[SUNRISE STREET]] and [[Timepiece phase II]].
* The woman in Dragon Blade's video and graphics is named Rinko Momoiro (桃色凛呼).
** Rinko later appeared as a selectable character in [[AC GFDM V3|GuitarFreaks V3 & DrumMania V3]]'s BATTLE MODE and in [[AC GD FUZZ-UP|GITADORA FUZZ-UP]]'s ''Daishuugou atsumare together! GITADORA All Star GIG!'' (大集合あつまれトゥギャザー！GITADORAオールスターGIG！) event.
* Dragon Blade is one of three EXTRA STAGE songs in [[CS GFDM MPG|GuitarFreaks & DrumMania MASTERPIECE GOLD]], along with [[VITALIZE]] and [[Kono ko no nanatsu no oiwai ni|この子の七つのお祝いに]]. Getting 95-97% Perfects will access [[MODEL DD4]] for ENCORE STAGE, and getting 98% Perfects or more on that accesses [[Concertino in Blue]] for the PREMIUM ENCORE STAGE.
* Dragon Blade is available for play in GuitarFreaksXG & DrumManiaXG as an unlockable song in Jukebox #1 (March 10th, 2010).
** As of April 23rd, 2010, it has been automatically unlocked into Standard Mode.
* Dragon Blade was added to jubeat saucer on August 29th, 2013 as part of the [[jubeat-GITADORA-DDR no Triple Journey|jubeat・GITADORA・DDRのTriple Journey]] unlock event, which started on August 1st, 2013.
** To unlock Dragon Blade on jubeat saucer, while sorting all songs by name, you must press on the panels カ-タ-ナ (ka-ta-na).
*** In the August 29th mail on the Triple Journey site, Smith-shi is seen wielding a katana.
** After the event ended, it can be unlocked in jubeat saucer via the ''bistro saucer'' unlocking event.
*** In [[AC jb saucer fulfill|jubeat saucer fulfill]], it can be unlocked as part of ''saucer macchiato'''s Side Menu from April 23rd, 2014.
*** In [[AC jb prop|jubeat prop]], it can be unlocked by playing it as a BONUS TUNE from May 28th, 2015.
*** In [[AC jb Qubell|jubeat Qubell]], it is one of the Garnet unlocks of the ''dig dig Qubell'' unlocking system.
*** In [[AC jb clan|jubeat clan]], it can be unlocked in the ''jubeat SHOP''.
*** In [[AC jb festo|jubeat festo]], it can be purchased at the ''emo MART''.
