* LOGICAL DASH received CHALLENGE charts in DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX's GRAND PRIX mode on December 25th, 2025, which become available by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX chart pack vol.6''' (グランプリ譜面パック vol.6).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, LOGICAL DASH's CHALLENGE charts can be played in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD.
** From December 28th, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, they are available by default for all players.

