* Before [[AC DDR X2|DanceDanceRevolution X2]] and in the Dance Maniax series, PUT YOUR FAITH IN ME ～SATURDAY NIGHT MIX～'s title was '''PUT YOUR FAITH IN ME (SATURDAY NIGHT MIX)'''.
** In [[AC DMX 2nd|Dance Maniax 2ndMIX]] and [[AC DMX 2nd append JPARADISE|Dance Maniax 2ndMIX append JPARADISE]], its title is displayed as simply '''PUT YOUR FAITH IN ME''' in the song wheel.
