== Song Production Information ==
Many people will probably recognize it from the intro immediately, but this is an arranged version of a number included in DanceDanceRevolution 2ndMIX. This is the second remix of the song, following [[PUT YOUR FAITH IN ME (Jazzy Groove)|JAZZY GROOVE]]. The female chorus and male rap combination, and the main melody, follows the original song. Heavy bass drums are added, and a synthesizer is used instead of a piano, giving it a completely different look. If you've never heard the original song, it's interesting to listen and compare them both.

