== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* The Least 100sec is the ENCORE STAGE for GUITARFREAKS 5thMIX & drummania 4thMIX. The song may be played by earning an S on [[CLASSIC PARTY 3]] on EXTRA STAGE.
* The Least 100sec is Hirofumi Sasaki's first original composition for BEMANI. He had earlier provided instruments for licensed covers in [[AC_GF4DM3|GUITARFREAKS 4thMIX & drummania 3rdMIX]].
** The Least 100sec being crossed over also marks his first appearance in the DanceDanceRevolution series.
*** The Least 100sec, along with [[I'M GONNA GET YOU!]] and [[Mikeneko rock|三毛猫ロック]] being crossed over also mark Yoshihiko Koezuka's first appearance in that series.
**** The Least 100sec, along with [[Destiny lovers]], I'M GONNA GET YOU!, [[JET WORLD]], and 三毛猫ロック being crossed over also mark Mutsuhiko Izumi's first appearance in that series.
* The Least 100sec shares several similarities with the Emerson, Lake & Palmer song ''Karn Evil 9: 2nd Impression'' from their 1974 album ''Brain Salad Surgery''.
* The Least 100sec is also the only song to make an appearance in at least one game of the beatmania/III, beatmania IIDX, DanceDanceRevolution, GuitarFreaks & DrumMania, KEYBOARDMANIA, pop'n music, REFLEC BEAT, and ノスタルジア series.
