** In the DanceDanceRevolution series, it is shown as '''Hirofumi Sasaki''' instead.
** The iTunes Store version of the ''REFLEC BEAT colette ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK VOL.2'' lists The Least 100sec's artist as '''SASAKI'''.
* The Least 100sec is one of the songs available for [[What Is GFDM#MultiSession GDK|MultiSession GDK]] play.
