== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* According to [[Takayuki Ishikawa|dj TAKA]]'s Q&A response on the [http://web.archive.org/web/20150710044306/http://www.konami.jp/am/bm2dx/bm2dx4/4th_question.html beatmania IIDX 4th style official website], DXY!'s title is pronounced "dixie", not "dee-echs-why".
