* DXY! is a hidden revival in [[AC DDRMAX2|DDRMAX2 -DanceDanceRevolution 7thMIX-]]. It can be unlocked by reaching level 4, or using an operator code to unlock it via 1st PASS.
** From [[AC DDR EXTREME|DanceDanceRevolution EXTREME]] onwards, it is playable by default.
* DXY! received a BEGINNER chart in [[AC DS EuroMIX2|Dancing Stage EuroMIX2]].
** With 57 jumps, DXY!'s BEGINNER chart has the most jumps of ''any'' BEGINNER chart in the DanceDanceRevolution franchise.
* DXY! received a different banner and Solo and Battle charts in [[CS DDR KONAMIX|DanceDanceRevolution KONAMIX]].
