This song considered the new tricks of DDR's step sequences, with crazy trap points throughout the song. Similar to [[INSERTiON]], this type of song contains trance-like elements that have never been found in DDR original songs until now. When you play this song for the first time, I wonder if you thought that the monitor froze for a moment? How many were caught in that illusion?

