This song was included in the DDR series and ParaParaParadise. Personally, Brilliant 2U&rarr;CELEBRATE NITE&rarr;DYNAMITE RAVE, are part of my first sound phase, and became a trilogy. TI think of this song as one of the songs from the good old days, representing the passionate BEMANI movement of that time. How many times did I want to present it in my form again besides this song? It was only in [[kiss me all night long]]. The connection between these two songs is that they contained my same "feelings" when I created them.

