== Song Production Information ==
=== DanceDanceRevolution 4thMIX ===
==== NAOKI MAEDA ====
I've been thinking about how this year Okinawa has been the focus of attention since the New Year, so this song was created as a new song for 4th MIX from the idea that I thought for a long time, "Is it possible to create a song that somehow includes Okinawan folk music?". It's a song that fuses traditional and contemporary popular music, and was made in collaboration with two actual Okinawan sanshin artists, so I think it became a song which has a unique presence in the game.

=== DanceDanceRevolution 4thMIX CS ===
This song has a southern island mood which heavily features Okinawan folk music. The Okinawan folk music and dance sounds brilliantly combine together. There's a charm with the lively melody contrasting the intense steps.

