* Despite TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～'s arcade debut being in DanceDanceRevolution Solo 2000, it is listed in the [[AC DDR 3rd|DanceDanceRevolution 3rdMIX]] folder from [[AC DDR X|DanceDanceRevolution X]] onwards, due to its appearance in DanceDanceRevolution 3rdMIX PLUS.
