* TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～ received a BEGINNER chart in [[AC DS EuroMIX|Dancing Stage EuroMIX]].
* TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～ has never appeared in an American PlayStation 2 DanceDanceRevolution release, being the only pre-[[AC DDR X3|X3]] TRIP MACHINE song to never appear in one.
* TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～ appears as downloadable content for [[CS DDR S+|DanceDanceRevolution S+]], in the '''TRIP MACHINE Pack 1'''.
* TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～ received a new jacket in [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], with updated text font.
* TRIP MACHINE～luv mix～ received CHALLENGE charts in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode on August 28th, 2025, which become available by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX chart pack vol.3''' (グランプリ譜面パック vol.3).
