** From August 31st, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, they are available by default for all players.

== Song Production Information ==
It's a REMIX of TRIP MACHINE by 2MB. With a monotonous repetition of sampled riffs, and ambient-influenced effects with lots of delays, it truly sublimated into a different song.<br>
It's an abnormal world where TRIP MACHINE is a lullaby to put children to sleep.<br>
Experience a TRIP with blurred boundaries of reality and emptiness.

