* GENOM SCREAMS received brand-new NORMAL charts in [[AC bm THE FINAL|beatmania THE FINAL]], replacing its old charts.
* GENOM SCREAMS received a brand new Single ANOTHER chart when it was revived in [[AC 9th style|beatmania IIDX 9th style]].
** It also received new NORMAL charts (different from its beatmania IIDX 3rd style CS LIGHT charts) in beatmania IIDX 9th style. 
** GENOM SCREAMS' old 14KEYS chart was moved up to Double ANOTHER, receiving a new Double HYPER chart as well.
* In the DanceDanceRevolution and REFLEC BEAT series, GENOM SCREAMS' artist is shown as '''L.E.D.LIGHT'''.
