== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ is the first song in the PARANOiA series that was not arranged by Naoki Maeda.
* Both PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ and [[MAKE A JAM!]] mark Yuichi Asami's debut in BEMANI.
