* The subtitle "～clean mix～" is a pun on [[PARANOiA MAX~DIRTY MIX~|PARANOiA MAX～DIRTY MIX～]]'s subtitle.
* On the back cover of [[CS DDR 2ndMIX DC|DanceDanceRevolution 2ndMIX Dreamcast Edition]], PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ is misspelled as '''PARANOiA KCET ～cleen mix～'''.
* PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ received a Double MANIAC chart in [[AC DDR 4th|DanceDanceRevolution 4thMIX]].
* PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ received a different Double MANIAC chart, as well as a BEGINNER chart, in [[AC DS EuroMIX|Dancing Stage EuroMIX]].
* From [[AC DDRMAX2|DDRMAX2 -DanceDanceRevolution 7thMIX-]] to [[AC DDR SuperNOVA2|DanceDanceRevolution SuperNOVA2]], PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～'s title was '''PARANOiA KCET (clean mix)'''.
* PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～'s banner was updated in [[AC DDR X|DanceDanceRevolution X]], changing the title font.
**However, [[CS DDR X JP|the Japanese home version of DanceDanceRevolution X]] kept the old banner.
* PARANOiA KCET ～clean mix～ received CHALLENGE charts as part of the ''鬼のEXTRA ATTACK'' (Oni no EXTRA ATTACK) event of [[AC DDR 2014|DanceDanceRevolution (2014)]]. These charts could be unlocked from October 16th, 2014, to November 13th, 2014, after unlocking the CHALLENGE charts for [[Kind Lady]], [[Malacca]], and [[Tribe]].
** From July 16th, 2015 to December 16th, 2015, these charts could be unlocked again via ''EXTRA ATTACK''.
