None.

== Song Connections / Remixes ==
* MAKE IT BETTER samples a portion of [[MONEY]] by RAGGA TWINS, which in turns samples ''The Teacher of Love'' by Ray Barretto [https://youtu.be/FIVrSpgtSXM?si=dGVAev5OpFWT8b6i&t=149].
** MAKE IT BETTER's vocals originates from ''Diamond Vocals'' by Best Service.
* A self-remix of MAKE IT BETTER, titled [[MAKE IT BETTER (So-REAL Mix)]], appears in [[AC DDR 2nd|DanceDanceRevolution 2ndMIX]].
* A remix of MAKE IT BETTER by FASTFORWARD appears in the [[DanceDanceRevolution 2ndMIX ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK]] NONSTOP MEGAMIX.
* A shorter version of MAKE IT BETTER appears in the KONAMI  arcade game ''Step Champ'' (ステップチャンプ) and the PlayStation game ''Bishi Bashi Special 3 ~Step Champ~'' (ビシバシスペシャル3 〜ステップチャンプ〜).

== Trivia ==
{{Gallery}}
* MAKE IT BETTER is one of the two KONAMI original songs introduced in the Internet Ranking Version of DanceDanceRevolution, along with [[TRIP MACHINE]].
* MAKE IT BETTER received an alternate chart in [[AC DDR 3rd|DanceDanceRevolution 3rdMIX]], titled "PF-MAKE".
* MAKE IT BETTER received a Double MANIAC in [[AC DDR 4th|DanceDanceRevolution 4thMIX]].
* MAKE IT BETTER received a BEGINNER chart in [[AC DDR USA|DanceDanceRevolution USA]].
** It received a different BEGINNER chart in [[CS DDR BEST HITS|DanceDanceRevolution BEST HITS]]. This chart is also used in [[CS DDR NA|DanceDanceRevolution CS (North America)]].
* MAKE IT BETTER received an updated banner and a new BEGINNER chart in [[AC DDR EXTREME|DanceDanceRevolution EXTREME]].
* MAKE IT BETTER appears as downloadable content for [[CS DDR S+|DanceDanceRevolution S+]], in the '''Mega Mix 4''' pack.
* MAKE IT BETTER received CHALLENGE charts in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode on July 11th, 2025, which become available by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX chart pack vol.2''' (グランプリ譜面パック vol.2).
** By purchasing the pack with an active subscription, MAKE IT BETTER's CHALLENGE charts can be played in [[AC DDR WORLD|DanceDanceRevolution WORLD]].
** From July 31st, 2026 in DanceDanceRevolution WORLD, they are available by default for all players.
** At over 25 years since its debut in DanceDanceRevolution Internet Ranking Version, MAKE IT BETTER holds the DanceDanceRevolution record for the longest gap between a song's debut and the addition of a new chart.

