== Trivia ==
* Poochie is one of the Refle unlockable songs in REFLEC BEAT groovin'!!. It can be purchased from the Reflec Shop for 1500 Refle.
** In [[AC RB VOLZZA|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA]] and [[AC RB VOLZZA 2|REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2]], Poochie is playable by default.
* Poochie received a SPECIAL chart in [[AC RB groovin'!! Upper|REFLEC BEAT groovin'!! Upper]] on March 6th, 2015, as part of the ''Ura MYSTICAL STRIKE'' (裏MYSTICAL STRIKE) event. To unlock it, you must beat Leviathan.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA, it could be purchased from the Garage for 8 VOLZZA KEYs.
** In REFLEC BEAT VOLZZA 2, it could be unlocked by clearing its HARD chart a specific number of times, depending on the grade obtained on it (AAA+: 1 time, AAA: 2 times, AA: 3 times, A or lower: 5 times).
* Poochie can be unlocked in DanceDanceRevolution (2014) from December 24th, 2015 via ''EXTRA ATTACK'' as part of the ''OSB～Winter★Special★Present～'' (OSB～ウィンター★スペシャル★プレゼント～) event. Note that the SURVIVED BONUS meter has to be filled on BEGINNER, then BASIC, DIFFICULT, and then finally EXPERT.
** Poochie's EXPERT charts do not have jumps (although they do have Freeze Arrows).
** In [[AC DDR A|DanceDanceRevolution A]], it can be unlocked through ''EXTRA SAVIOR''.
** As of [[AC DDR A20|DanceDanceRevolution A20]], it is available by default.
* From DanceDanceRevolution A onwards, Poochie appears in the DanceDanceRevolution A folder instead of the (2014) folder.
* After being removed from the initial release of [[AC RB Reflesia|REFLEC BEAT 悠久のリフレシア]], Poochie was revived on August 16th, 2018.
* Poochie is one of the unlocks of the ''DANCERUSH STARDOM GYM2'' event. It could be unlocked from November 7th to December 23rd, 2019, and from June 8th to August 2nd, 2020 with 30 ★ after finishing the ''SpongeBob Training'' (スポンジボブトレーニング) course.
** From November 11th, 2020 onwards, it could be purchased with 40 ★ without prerequisites.
** As of February 28th, 2024, it is playable by default.
* Poochie is available in [[CS DDR GRAND PRIX|DanceDanceRevolution GRAND PRIX]]'s GRAND PRIX mode from May 23rd, 2022, by purchasing '''GRAND PRIX music pack vol.6''' (グランプリ楽曲パック vol.6).
* Poochie is available in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR コナステ from October 11th, 2023, by purchasing '''Konasute SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT Selection Music Pack vol.1''' (コナステ版 SOUND VOLTEX REFLEC BEAT セレクション 楽曲パック vol.1).
* Poochie could be unlocked in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR from August 1st to September 24th, 2024, as part of the ''REFLEC BEAT Special Stamp!'' (REFLEC BEAT スペシャルスタンプ！) event, by obtaining 10 stamps.
** Since September 11th, 2025, it can be purchased in SOUND VOLTEX EXCEED GEAR with PCB.

